#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item how far a substitute's own widths differ from the ones the page states"
msgid "The widths differ by up to %1/1000 em. Nothing moves, because the document's own widths are kept, but the letters do not quite fill the room reserved for them."
msgstr "宽度最多相差 %1/1000 em。由于保留了文档自身的宽度，任何内容都不会移位，但字母不会完全填满为它们预留的空间。"

