msgstr "重新读取"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:293
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Which Characters"
msgstr "包含哪些字符"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:295
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "What the selected font lets this document address. Text edited in that font can use these characters and no others, unless a font is added."
msgstr "所选字体允许本文档使用的字符。除非添加字体，否则用该字体编辑的文本只能使用这些字符。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:299 src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "What This Cannot Promise"
msgstr "本功能的局限"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:308 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:234
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info legend for the three tick columns"
msgid "Emb = the glyphs travel with the document · Sub = only part of the font is here · Uni = its text can be copied"
msgstr "嵌入 = 字形随文档一起传递 · 子集 = 这里只有字体的一部分 · Uni = 它的文本可以复制"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip what a font's own licence bits say"
msgid "Licence: %1"
msgstr "许可证：%1"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:363 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:223
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item the font names no encoding of its own"
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:375 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid "No page in this document uses a font. A scan is all picture, and has none until its text has been recognised."
msgstr "本文档中没有任何页面使用字体。扫描件全部是图片，在识别其文本之前不含任何字体。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:387
#, kde-format
msgid "One font."
msgid_plural "%1 fonts."
msgstr[0] "%1 种字体。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:389
#, kde-format
msgid "One of them is not embedded, so it depends on the reader having that face."
msgid_plural "%1 of them are not embedded, so they depend on the reader having those faces."
msgstr[0] "其中 %1 种未嵌入，因此要依赖阅读端装有相应的字体。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:394
#, kde-format
msgid "One has no /ToUnicode map, so its text cannot be copied out or searched."
msgid_plural "%1 have no /ToUnicode map, so their text cannot be copied out or searched."
msgstr[0] "有 %1 种没有 /ToUnicode 映射，因此它们的文本无法复制或搜索。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:398
#, kde-format
msgid "The embedded font programmes come to %1 of a %2 file."
msgstr "嵌入的字体程序共占 %1，而整个文件为 %2。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:406 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "%1 is not embedded, so the reader will substitute another face and the lines will shift."
msgstr "%1 未嵌入，阅读端会用其他字体替代，行的排布会因此移位。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:412 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "%1 has no /ToUnicode map, so its text cannot be copied, searched or read aloud."
msgstr "%1 没有 /ToUnicode 映射，因此它的文本无法复制、搜索或朗读。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:418
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "%1 says nothing anywhere about what its character codes mean, so its text cannot be edited."
msgstr "%1 没有在任何地方说明它的字符代码是什么含义，因此无法编辑它的文本。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:425 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing wrong with the fonts in this document."
msgstr "本文档的字体没有任何问题。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgid "One thing to put right:"
msgid_plural "%1 things to put right:"
msgstr[0] "有 %1 项需要修正："

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:436 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a font and what its licence bits say"
msgid "%1: %2"
msgstr "%1：%2"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:442
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title heading before a list"
msgid "Licences, as the fonts themselves state them:"
msgstr "字体自身声明的许可证："

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:493
#, kde-format
msgid "This font says nothing about what its character codes mean, so nothing set in it can be edited. Adding a font is the way round that."
msgstr "此字体没有说明它的字符代码是什么含义，因此用它排版的内容都无法编辑。添加字体可以绕开这一限制。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:496
#, kde-format
msgid "One character can be addressed:"
msgid_plural "%1 characters can be addressed:"
msgstr[0] "可以使用 %1 个字符："

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:514
#, kde-format
msgid "Read from the /ToUnicode map where there is one and from the encoding otherwise, so the font this came from may well hold more. What decides whether text can be changed is what the document can address, which is this."
msgstr "有 /ToUnicode 映射时从映射读取，否则从编码读取，因此这些字符所来自的字体很可能还包含更多字符。决定文本能否修改的是文档可以使用的字符，也就是这里列出的这些。"

