#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Put in their place:"
msgstr "替代字体:"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:568
#, kde-format
msgid "The font object the pages already point at is the one that gains the glyphs, so no page is rewritten: every character code keeps the meaning it had and every width the document states is kept, which is what stops the text reflowing. Left empty, a metrically compatible face is chosen from what the document asks for: Liberation Sans for Helvetica, and so on."
msgstr "获得字形的是页面本来就指向的那个字体对象，因此不会重写任何页面：每个字符代码都保持原有的含义，文档声明的每个宽度也都保留下来，文本因此不会重排。留空时，会按照文档的要求选用一款字宽兼容的字体，例如用 Liberation Sans 代替 Helvetica。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:576
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Embed the Missing Faces"
msgstr "嵌入缺少的字体"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:582
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Text that cannot be copied"
msgstr "无法复制的文本"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:583
#, kde-format
msgid "A /ToUnicode map is worked out from the font's own encoding (a /Differences array saying /eacute means the code beside it draws an é) and written back into the file, so that every other program can read the text out too."
msgstr "程序会根据字体自身的编码推算出 /ToUnicode 映射（例如 /Differences 数组中的 /eacute 表明旁边的代码绘制的是 é），并把它写回文件，这样其他所有程序也能读出其中的文本。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:590
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Make the Text Copyable"
msgstr "让文本可以复制"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:595
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "The same font several times over"
msgstr "同一字体的多份副本"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:596
#, kde-format
msgid "What produces duplicates is merging documents: three chapters, each carrying its own subset of the same typeface, become one file carrying three. Subsets that are the same programme with the same encoding become one object every page points at; ones that genuinely hold different glyphs are left alone."
msgstr "产生重复字体的原因是合并文档：三个章节各自携带同一款字体的子集，合并后就成了一个文件里的三份。程序相同、编码也相同的子集会合并成一个对象，供所有页面共同指向；确实包含不同字形的子集则保持原样。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:603
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Join the Duplicates"
msgstr "合并重复的字体"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:626 src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2470
#, kde-format
msgid "Every font this document uses already travels with it, so there is nothing to embed."
msgstr "本文档使用的每一种字体都已随文档一起保存，因此没有需要嵌入的字体。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:651
#, kde-format
msgid "The pages were not rewritten and did not need to be: the font objects they already point at are the ones that gained the glyphs."
msgstr "页面没有被重写，也无需重写：获得字形的正是页面本来就指向的那些字体对象。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:663
#, kde-format
msgid "Every font in this document already says what its characters mean."
msgstr "本文档中的每一种字体都已说明它的字符是什么含义。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:677
#, kde-format
msgid "Wrote a /ToUnicode map for one font."
msgid_plural "Wrote a /ToUnicode map for %1 fonts."
msgstr[0] "已为 %1 种字体写入 /ToUnicode 映射。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:679 src/cli/CommandsFonts.cpp:504
#, kde-format
msgid "Their text can be copied and searched now, by this program and by any other."
msgstr "现在无论是本程序还是其他任何程序，都可以复制和搜索它们的文本。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:695
#, kde-format
msgid "Reduced one duplicate font to the one the pages now share."
msgid_plural "Reduced %1 duplicate fonts to the ones the pages now share."
msgstr[0] "已将 %1 种重复的字体合并为页面现在共用的字体。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:708
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Whole fonts where a few letters would do"
msgstr "只用到几个字母却嵌入了整套字体"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:709
#, kde-format
msgid "The commonest reason a two-page letter weighs a megabyte. What the pages actually draw is measured from the content streams (every page, every form, every annotation) and the rest of each embedded font is left behind. Nothing on any page changes: the encoding, the widths and the character codes are untouched, and only the glyph programme is rewritten. A font whose codes cannot be resolved to glyphs is left exactly as it was and named in the report."
msgstr "这是两页的信件却有一兆字节大小的最常见原因。程序会从内容流中（每一个页面、每一个表单、每一个批注）统计页面实际绘制的内容，舍弃每种嵌入字体中其余的部分。页面上的任何内容都不会改变：编码、宽度和字符代码都保持不动，只有字形程序会被重写。如果某种字体的代码无法解析为字形，它会完全保持原样，并在报告中列出名称。"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:719
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Cut the Fonts Down to What Is Used"
msgstr "将字体缩减为实际用到的部分"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:724
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Fonts every machine has anyway"
msgstr "每台机器本来就有的字体"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:726
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Every embedded font"
msgstr "所有嵌入的字体"

#: src/ui/ToolFontsDialog.cpp:727
#, kde-format
msgid "The glyphs go and the reference stays. The text is still there and still selectable; what goes is the guarantee that it will look the same elsewhere, so this is a trade rather than an improvement."
msgstr "字形被删除，引用则保留下来。文本依然存在，也依然可以选择；失去的是它在别处显示效果一致的保证，所以这是一种取舍，而不是改进。"

