msgid "This is what lifts the one real limit on editing text: a document that never contained an umlaut cannot be made to say “Müller” with the font it carries. Only the characters asked for go in, cut out of the font file itself, which is what keeps a nine-character correction from adding three quarters of a megabyte. The text already on those pages goes on using the fonts it always did: this adds a resource to write with, not a replacement for what is there."
msgstr "这项功能解除了编辑文本时唯一真正的限制：一个从未包含变音字母的文档，用它自带的字体写不出“Müller”。只有指定的字符会被嵌入，它们是从字体文件中截取出来的，正因如此，修改九个字符才不会让文件增加四分之三兆字节。那些页面上原有的文本仍旧使用它一直使用的字体：这里添加的是一份可供书写的资源，而不是对现有内容的替换。"

