msgid ""
"The four optional boxes are written as one set, so a box left unticked is taken away from the pages that have it. /MediaBox is the exception: a page without one is not a page, so leaving it unticked leaves it alone.\n"
"\n"
"Boxes have to nest. An arrangement where they do not is refused with the offender named rather than written, because an imposition program handed a /TrimBox outside its /MediaBox does something nobody can predict."
msgstr ""
"四个可选页面框会作为一组整体写入，因此未勾选的框会从原本拥有它的页面上删除。/MediaBox 是个例外：没有它的页面就不成其为页面，所以不勾选它，就是不去动它。\n"
"\n"
"页面框必须层层嵌套。不满足嵌套关系的设置会被拒绝，并指出出问题的那个框，而不会写入文件，因为拼版程序拿到一个超出 /MediaBox 的 /TrimBox 时，会做出谁也无法预料的事情。"

