msgstr "内容:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:699
#, kde-format
msgid "The content stream is wrapped rather than rebuilt, so nothing is rasterised and nothing is re-encoded: a scan brought to A5 is the same scan at the same resolution. A sideways page asked for A4 gets a sideways A4."
msgstr "内容流只是被包装起来，而不是重新构建，因此不会栅格化，也不会重新编码：缩到 A5 的扫描件仍是同一份扫描件，分辨率不变。横向的页面选择 A4 时，得到的是横向的 A4。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:706 src/ui/ToolObjectsDialog.cpp:915
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Resize"
msgstr "更改大小"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:713
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Bring every page to one size"
msgstr "把所有页面统一为一种大小"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:718
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "One size:"
msgstr "统一大小:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:721
#, kde-format
msgid "“The largest page” is measured by area, not by taking the widest width and the tallest height: a document of portrait and landscape A4 would otherwise land on a square sheet no paper tray has ever held. This works on the whole document, so there is no page selection."
msgstr "“最大的页面”按面积衡量，而不是取最大的宽度和最大的高度：否则一个同时含纵向和横向 A4 的文档，就会落到一种任何纸盒都装不下的方形纸张上。此操作作用于整个文档，因此没有页面选择。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:729
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Unify the Sizes"
msgstr "统一大小"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:765
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Put one page on %2."
msgid_plural "Put %1 pages on %2."
msgstr[0] "已将 %1 页放到 %2 上。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:785
#, kde-format
msgid "Brought every page to %1."
msgstr "已将所有页面统一为 %1。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:797
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "出血"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:799
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Three millimetres is what most printers ask for."
msgstr "大多数印刷厂要求 3 毫米。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:804
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Bleed:"
msgstr "出血:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:807
#, kde-format
msgid "The /TrimBox becomes what the page shows now and the /BleedBox that grown on all four sides. The /MediaBox grows with it where it has to: bleed is ink that runs past the cut, and it needs paper to run onto."
msgstr "/TrimBox 会变成页面当前显示的范围，/BleedBox 则是该范围向四周扩大后的结果。/MediaBox 会在必要时随之扩大：出血是超出裁切线的油墨，它需要纸张来承载。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:813
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Set the Bleed"
msgstr "设置出血"

