msgid "Outside the trim by:"
msgstr "在裁剪框外:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:840
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Mark length:"
msgstr "标记长度:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:841
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Line width:"
msgstr "线宽:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:843
#, kde-format
msgid "Drawn in a separation that appears on every plate, since a registration mark that came out on the cyan plate alone would be worse than none. The sheet grows around the content where it stands, so page coordinates and annotations stay where they were. Every page is marked: marks have to line up sheet to sheet, so there is no page selection here."
msgstr "标记使用一种会出现在每块印版上的分色绘制，因为只印在青版上的套准标记还不如没有。纸张会围绕内容向外扩大，内容位置不变，因此页面坐标和批注都留在原处。所有页面都会加上标记：标记必须一张一张对齐，因此这里没有页面选择。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:852
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Add the Marks"
msgstr "添加标记"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:889
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Gave one page a %2 mm bleed."
msgid_plural "Gave %1 pages a %2 mm bleed."
msgstr[0] "已为 %1 页添加 %2 mm 出血。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:891
#, kde-format
msgid "The trim is what those pages showed before; the sheet grew where it had to."
msgstr "裁剪框就是这些页面此前显示的范围；纸张已在必要处扩大。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:909 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:594
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a kind of printer's mark"
msgid "crop marks"
msgstr "裁切标记"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:912 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:597
