msgid "registration marks"
msgstr "套准标记"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:915 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:600
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a kind of printer's mark"
msgid "colour bars"
msgstr "色标条"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:918 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:603
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a kind of printer's mark"
msgid "page information"
msgstr "页面信息"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:921
#, kde-format
msgid "No mark is ticked, so there is nothing to add."
msgstr "没有勾选任何标记，因此没有可添加的内容。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:933 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:606
#, kde-format
msgid "Added %1, %2 mm outside the trim."
msgstr "已添加 %1，位于裁剪框外 %2 mm 处。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:945
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Cut each page in two"
msgstr "把每一页裁成两半"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:947
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Down the middle, into a left and a right half"
msgstr "从中间竖切，分成左右两半"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:949
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Across, into a top and a bottom half"
msgstr "横切，分成上下两半"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:957
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Measured from the left for a cut down the middle, from the top for a cut across, and on the page as it is displayed, so a rotated page cuts where it looks like it will."
msgstr "竖切时从左边量起，横切时从上边量起，并且以页面显示出来的样子为准，因此旋转过的页面会在看上去的位置裁开。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:964
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Cut at:"
msgstr "裁切位置:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:967
#, kde-format
msgid "The scanned-book fix, where one photograph holds two facing pages. Both halves keep pointing at the one original content stream, so no pixel is resampled and the file barely grows."
msgstr "这是针对扫描书籍的处理办法，也就是一张照片上有相对的两页。两半仍然指向同一个原始内容流，因此不会重新采样任何像素，文件也几乎不会变大。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:973
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Cut the Pages"
msgstr "裁切页面"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:982
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "One page across several sheets"
msgstr "把一页分布到多张纸上"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:987
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Draw the cut line and number each sheet"
msgstr "画出裁切线并为每张纸编号"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:991 src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:704
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Page:"
msgstr "页面:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:992
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Sheet size:"
msgstr "纸张大小:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:993
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Sheets overlap by:"
msgstr "纸张重叠:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:996
#, kde-format
msgid "The page is tiled at the size it already is. For a wall-sized poster out of an A4 page, resize it first and tile that: one call that both enlarged and tiled would have to guess which of the two the sheet size meant."
msgstr "页面按它当前的大小平铺。要把一个 A4 页面做成整面墙的海报，请先更改大小，再平铺：如果一次操作既放大又平铺，就只能去猜纸张大小指的是两者中的哪一个。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1003
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Make the Poster"
msgstr "制作海报"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1038
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Cut one page in two."
msgid_plural "Cut %1 pages in two."
msgstr[0] "已将 %1 页裁成两半。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1039
#, kde-format
msgid "The left half comes first, then the right."
msgstr "左半部分在前，右半部分在后。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1040
#, kde-format
msgid "The top half comes first, then the bottom."
msgstr "上半部分在前，下半部分在后。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1062
#, kde-format
msgid "Tiled page %2 across one sheet of %3."
msgid_plural "Tiled page %2 across %1 sheets of %3."
msgstr[0] "已将第 %2 页平铺到 %1 张 %3 纸上。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1065
#, kde-format
msgid "Every edge a neighbouring sheet overlaps carries its cut line, and the sheets are numbered."
msgstr "每一条与相邻纸张重叠的边上都画有裁切线，并且每张纸都已编号。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1078
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Booklet order"
msgstr "小册子顺序"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1079
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Reading order into printer's spreads"
msgstr "从阅读顺序转为印刷跨页"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1081
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Printer's spreads back into reading order"
msgstr "从印刷跨页转回阅读顺序"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1083
#, kde-format
msgid "Eight pages become 8, 1, 2, 7, 6, 3, 4, 5, which is the order a saddle-stitched booklet is laid down in. The pages are reordered, not paired onto sheets: run “Arrange on Sheets” with two pages per sheet over the result to get the sheets themselves."
msgstr "八个页面会变成 8、1、2、7、6、3、4、5，这正是骑马订小册子的放置顺序。此操作只是重新排序，并不会把页面配对到纸张上：请对结果运行“拼版到纸张”，每张纸两页，才能得到纸张本身。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1091
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Reorder"
msgstr "重新排序"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1099
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Lay another document over this one"
msgstr "把另一个文档叠加到本文档上"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1101
#, kde-format
msgid "The PDF to lay on top"
msgstr "要叠加在上层的 PDF"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1102 src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:344
#: src/ui/ToolObjectsDialog.cpp:1152
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Choose…"
msgstr "选择…"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1108
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Start the overlay again when it runs out"
msgstr "叠加层用完后从头再来一遍"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "What a letterhead or a background wants. Without it, the pages past the end of the overlay are left exactly as they were."
msgstr "信头或背景通常需要此选项。不勾选时，超出叠加层范围的页面会完全保持原样。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1114
#, kde-format
msgid "Page one goes on page one, and so on. The overlay is scaled to the base page's visible area, so a letterhead drawn a millimetre off still lands square."
msgstr "第一页叠到第一页，依此类推。叠加层会缩放到基础页面的可见区域，因此信头即使画的时候偏了一毫米，也依然能对正。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1121
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Lay It Over"
msgstr "叠加上去"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1135
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Document to Lay Over"
msgstr "要叠加的文档"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1136 src/ui/MainWindow.cpp:128
#: src/ui/ToolFormBuilderDialog.cpp:1705 src/ui/ToolFormBuilderDialog.cpp:1738
#, kde-format
msgid "PDF documents (*.pdf);;All files (*)"
msgstr "PDF 文档 (*.pdf);;所有文件 (*)"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1158
#, kde-format
msgid "Reordered into printer's spreads. Run “Arrange on Sheets” with two pages per sheet over this to get the sheets themselves."
msgstr "已重新排列为印刷跨页。请对此结果运行“拼版到纸张”，每张纸两页，以得到纸张本身。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1160 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:744
#, kde-format
msgid "Put the pages back into reading order."
msgstr "已把页面恢复为阅读顺序。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1169
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose a PDF to lay over this document first."
msgstr "请先选择要叠加到本文档上的 PDF。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1182
#, kde-format
msgid "Laid %1 over the document."
msgstr "已将 %1 叠加到文档上。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1183
#, kde-format
msgid "The overlay started again whenever it ran out."
msgstr "叠加层每次用完后都从头重新开始。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1184
#, kde-format
msgid "Pages past the end of the overlay were left as they were."
msgstr "超出叠加层范围的页面保持原样。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1196
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:column"
msgid "From page"
msgstr "起始页面"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1196
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:column"
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1197
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:column"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "前缀"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1197
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:column"
msgid "Start at"
msgstr "起始编号"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1201
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Add a Range"
msgstr "添加范围"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1203
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Remove the Range"
msgstr "移除范围"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1204
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Show the Numbers Now"
msgstr "立即显示页码"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1212
#, kde-format
msgid "These are the numbers a reader shows in its page box (“iv” for the fourth front-matter page), not anything printed on the paper. Each range runs until the next one begins, so front matter starting at page 1 in lower-case roman and the body starting at page 9 in decimal is two ranges."
msgstr "这些是阅读器在页码框中显示的编号（前言部分的第四页显示为“iv”），而不是印在纸上的任何内容。每个范围一直延续到下一个范围开始，因此从第 1 页起用小写罗马数字的前言部分，和从第 9 页起用阿拉伯数字的正文部分，就是两个范围。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1220
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Write the Numbering"
msgstr "写入页码编号"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1277 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:777
#, kde-format
msgid "This document has no page labels, so readers show the physical page numbers."
msgstr "此文档没有页面标签，因此阅读器显示实际的页码。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1285 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:781
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info physical page number, then the label the reader shows"
msgid "Page %1: %2"
msgstr "第 %1 页：%2"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1311
#, kde-format
msgid "Add a numbering range first."
msgstr "请先添加一个编号范围。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1329
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Wrote one numbering range."
msgid_plural "Wrote %1 numbering ranges."
msgstr[0] "已写入 %1 个编号范围。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1331
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info one numbering range: where it starts and how it counts"
msgid "From page %1: %2"
msgstr "从第 %1 页起：%2"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1349
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "How much painting a page may still contain and count as blank. Zero insists on a page that paints nothing whatsoever; two forgives a running head and a page number."
msgstr "页面上最多可以有多少绘制内容，仍然算作空白。设为零，要求页面完全不画任何东西；设为二，则可以容忍一个页眉和一个页码。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1354
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Find the Blank Pages"
msgstr "查找空白页面"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1357
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Painting operators allowed:"
msgstr "允许的绘制操作符数量:"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1362
#, kde-format
msgid "Read from the content streams rather than by rendering: a page whose streams hold no painting operator paints nothing, and that can be established without a rasteriser and without an opinion about colour."
msgstr "此判断读取内容流，而不是渲染页面：内容流中没有绘制操作符的页面就什么也画不出来，无需栅格化器，也无需对颜色做任何判断，即可确定这一点。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1368
#, kde-format
msgid "Not looked for yet."
msgstr "尚未查找。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1373
#, kde-format
msgid "Pages to take out, e.g. 3, 7-9"
msgstr "要移除的页面，例如 3, 7-9"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1376
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Take These Pages Out"
msgstr "移除这些页面"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1381
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Take pages out"
msgstr "移除页面"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1382
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled in by the search above, and editable afterwards. This writes a shorter document rather than touching the one on screen, so nothing is lost by trying it."
msgstr "此处由上方的查找结果填入，之后仍可编辑。此操作会写出一个更短的文档，而不会改动屏幕上的文档，因此试一下不会损失任何东西。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1417 src/cli/CommandsLayout.cpp:884
#, kde-format
msgid "Every page paints something."
msgstr "每一页都绘制了内容。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1422
#, kde-format
msgid "One page paints nothing: %2."
msgid_plural "%1 pages paint nothing: %2."
msgstr[0] "有%1页未绘制任何内容：%2。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1431
#, kde-format
msgid "Name the pages to take out. Leaving this empty would mean all of them."
msgstr "填写要移除的页面。留空则表示全部页面。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1447
#, kde-format
msgid "That is every page, and a document without pages is not a document."
msgstr "这是全部页面，而不含任何页面的文档就不再是文档了。"

#: src/ui/ToolLayoutDialog.cpp:1460
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Took out one page: %2."
msgid_plural "Took out %1 pages: %2."
msgstr[0] "已移除%1页：%2。"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2082 src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:1875
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The file behind this page is not available, so its pictures cannot be read."
msgstr "此页面所属的文件不可用，因此无法读取其中的图片。"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2117
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The picture in that box is stored in a form this program cannot open: a fax or a JPEG 2000 image, whose pixels nothing here can read."
msgstr "那个框中的图片以本程序无法打开的格式存储：传真图像或 JPEG 2000 图像，其像素数据在这里无法读取。"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2129 src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:1884
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info there is nowhere to write a temporary file"
msgid "A picture could not be copied: this machine has nowhere to put it while it is being read out of the file."
msgstr "无法复制图片：从文件中读出图片时，本机没有可存放临时文件的位置。"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2140 src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:1892
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 names a picture, %2 says what went wrong"
msgid "%1 could not be copied: %2"
msgstr "无法复制%1：%2"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2147 src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:1899
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 names a picture"
msgid "%1 came out of the file in a form this program cannot read back."
msgstr "从文件中取出的%1采用了本程序无法读回的格式。"

#: src/ui/PageView.cpp:2167
