#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:448
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info why no field can be added to this document"
msgid "This document carries an XFA form, which is a second and incompatible description of the same fields. Nothing can be added to it or changed in it here, because the result would behave differently in every reader."
msgstr "本文档带有 XFA 表单，它是对同一批字段的第二套且互不兼容的描述。在这里既不能向其中添加内容，也不能修改其中的内容，否则结果在每个阅读器中的表现都会不同。"

