msgid_plural "%1 fields have more than one button sharing their name, and such a field keeps the places its author gave it. Their boxes cannot be moved or resized from here."
msgstr[0] "有%1个字段的名称由多个按钮共用，这类字段会保留其作者设定的位置。无法在此移动它们的框或调整其大小。"

