#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "A field needs a name."
msgstr "字段必须有名称。"

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:470
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 is a field name"
msgid "This document already has a field called “%1”."
msgstr "本文档中已有名为“%1”的字段。"

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:476
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 and %2 are field names"
msgid "A field can be renamed but not moved into another group, so “%1” cannot become “%2”. Anything in the document referring to it by name would be left pointing at nothing."
msgstr "字段可以重命名，但不能移动到另一个分组中，因此“%1”不能变成“%2”。文档中按名称引用它的内容都会失去指向。"

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:483
#, kde-format
msgid "The four scripts are shown as the document wrote them and are kept exactly as they are. They cannot be edited here: the engine writes only the formatting, validation and calculation actions it generates itself, and hand-written script is not something it can promise to write back."
msgstr "这四段脚本按文档中写下的原样显示，并会原样保留。它们无法在此编辑：引擎只写入自己生成的格式化、验证和计算动作，无法保证把手写脚本原样写回。"

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:490
#, kde-format
msgid "A password box, a list that takes several answers and a drop-down that also accepts typing are not among what is read back from a form, so these three start unticked whatever the document says. Changing anything at all about a field rewrites all of its flags, so tick them again here if the field had them."
msgstr "密码框、可接受多个答案的列表框，以及也允许输入的下拉框，这三项不在从表单读回的信息之列，因此无论文档如何设置，它们都以未勾选的状态开始。对字段做任何修改都会重写它的全部标志，所以如果原字段带有这些属性，请在此重新勾选。"

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:498
#, kde-format
msgid "The form says this field offers a choice but not whether it drops down or stays open, so it is shown as a drop-down. Set it to a list if that is what it was."
msgstr "表单只说明此字段提供选项，却未说明它是下拉展开还是始终展开，因此这里按下拉框显示。如果它原本是列表框，请改设为列表框。"

