msgstr "决定单词断开时至少要留下多少个字母：德语留两个，其他语言留三个。"

#: src/ui/ToolTypesetDialog.cpp:580
#, kde-format
msgid "Three of the fourteen standard fonts: Helvetica has no serifs, Times has them, Courier is monospaced. None of them is embedded, so the file stays a few kilobytes and every reader on earth can show it. The price is the alphabet: western Europe and no further."
msgstr "十四种标准字体中的三种：Helvetica 无衬线，Times 有衬线，Courier 等宽。它们都不会被嵌入，因此文件只有几千字节，世界上任何阅读器都能显示。代价是字符集：只覆盖西欧文字，再多就不行了。"

#: src/ui/ToolTypesetDialog.cpp:587
#, kde-format
msgid "Headings are not set here. A Markdown heading takes the body's font, larger and bold, with the space above and below that goes with its size, which is what keeps a document set in Times from getting Helvetica headings."
