msgstr "旋转图片"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "A turn is a matrix in the content stream, so not one stored byte of the picture is rewritten: a fax or a JPEG 2000 turns as well as a JPEG, and any angle works."
msgstr "旋转只是内容流里的一个矩阵，因此图片存储的字节一个也不会被重写：传真图像或 JPEG 2000 和 JPEG 一样可以旋转，而且任意角度都行。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:315
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Fit a replacement inside the old place rather than stretch it"
msgstr "让替换的图片适应原来的位置，而不是拉伸填满"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:333
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
