msgstr "导出全部图片…"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:417
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Finer than %1 dpi, which is more than any printer will show. Bringing it down is free size."
msgstr "分辨率高于 %1 dpi，超出任何打印机能呈现的程度。把它降下来可以白白省下体积。"

