msgid_plural "%1 of them sit above %2 dpi and hold %3, more than any printer will show. The second tab brings them down."
msgstr[0] "其中 %1 张高于 %2 dpi，占用 %3，超出任何打印机能呈现的程度。第二个标签页可以把它们降下来。"

