msgstr "1-4, 8, 12-"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:732 src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:699
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item dots-per-inch suffix in a spin box"
msgid " dpi"
msgstr " dpi"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:733
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:spinbox no downsampling at all"
msgid "keep every pixel"
msgstr "保留全部像素"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:735
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Anything finer than this comes down to it. 150 is right for reading on screen, 300 for printing. Nothing is ever enlarged."
msgstr "分辨率高于此值的图片都会降到此值。150 适合在屏幕上阅读，300 适合打印。任何图片都不会被放大。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:743
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Re-pack the pixels rather than re-encode them as JPEG"
msgstr "重新打包像素，而不是重新编码为 JPEG"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:745
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Loses nothing at all, and saves far less. Right for a screenshot or a diagram, wrong for a photograph."
msgstr "完全无损，但省下的体积要少得多。适合截图或图表，不适合照片。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:748
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Turn the pictures grey on the way through"
msgstr "处理时顺便把图片转为灰度"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:750
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Re-encode even where the resolution is already right"
msgstr "即使分辨率已经合适也重新编码"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:752
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Off, a picture that needs nothing is left byte for byte alone. On, the quality is applied whatever the resolution says, which is the answer to “smaller without losing resolution” and costs a generation of JPEG loss every time."
msgstr "关闭时，无需处理的图片会逐字节原样保留。开启时，无论分辨率如何都会应用所设的质量，这正是“不降低分辨率也要变小”的答案，代价是每次都多一代 JPEG 损失。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:757
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Work on:"
msgstr "处理对象:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:759
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Bring down to:"
msgstr "降低到:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:760 src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:373
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "JPEG quality:"
msgstr "JPEG 质量:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:765
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture drawn on several pages is re-encoded once, and sized for the largest place it is drawn anywhere: downsampling for a thumbnail would ruin the full-page copy of the same object. What is reported is the bytes that left the picture streams, so a run with nothing to do reports exactly zero."
msgstr "在多个页面上绘制的同一张图片只会重新编码一次，并按它在任何位置绘制过的最大尺寸来定分辨率：为缩略图降采样会毁掉同一对象的整页副本。报告的数字是图片流中减少的字节数，因此无事可做的一次运行报告的正好是零。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:772
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Make Them Smaller"
msgstr "压缩图片"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:803
#, kde-format
msgid "No picture is picked. Choose a row in the first tab, or work on the whole document."
msgstr "未选中任何图片。请在第一个标签页中选择一行，或者对整个文档进行处理。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:838 src/cli/CommandsImages.cpp:184
#, kde-format
msgid "Those pages hold no picture whose pixels this tool can open."
msgstr "这些页面上没有本工具能够打开像素的图片。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:862
#, kde-format
msgid "With every pixel kept and no re-encoding forced, there is nothing for this to do. Give it a resolution to come down to, or tick the last box."
msgstr "既保留全部像素又不强制重新编码，就没有任何事情可做。请给出一个要降到的分辨率，或者勾选最后一个复选框。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:878 src/cli/CommandsImages.cpp:423
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 left the picture streams."
msgstr "图片流中减少了 %1。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:879
#, kde-format
msgid "No picture needed re-encoding, so the result is a copy of the original. A lower resolution or quality would give it something to work with."
msgstr "没有图片需要重新编码，因此结果只是原文件的一份副本。降低分辨率或质量才会有可处理的余地。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:882
#, kde-format
msgid "Left one picture alone: its pixels are stored in a form this cannot open."
msgid_plural "Left %1 pictures alone: their pixels are stored in a form this cannot open."
msgstr[0] "有 %1 张图片未作处理：它们的像素以本工具无法打开的形式存储。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:903
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "The values in the pixels"
msgstr "像素的数值"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:920
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Above one lifts the midtones, below one lowers them."
msgstr "大于 1 会提亮中间调，小于 1 会压暗中间调。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:922
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "锐化"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:923
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Take the specks out of a scan"
msgstr "去除扫描件上的杂点"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:924
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Spread the tones over the full range"
msgstr "把色调拉开到整个范围"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:925
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Reduce to grey"
msgstr "转为灰度"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:926
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Reduce to black and white"
msgstr "转为黑白"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:932
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Above this level a pixel becomes white, below it black."
msgstr "高于此值的像素变为白色，低于此值的变为黑色。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:935
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Brightness:"
msgstr "亮度:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:936
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Contrast:"
msgstr "对比度:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:937
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr "伽马:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:943 src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Black-and-white threshold:"
msgstr "黑白阈值:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:945
#, kde-format
msgid "The picture keeps its place on the page and its number of pixels; only the values change. One shared with another page is copied first, so that page keeps what it had."
msgstr "图片在页面上的位置和像素数量保持不变，只有数值发生变化。与其他页面共用的图片会先复制一份，因此那个页面仍保持原样。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:952
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Work Over the Pixels"
msgstr "处理像素"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:959
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Cut pixels away for good"
msgstr "永久裁掉像素"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:975 src/ui/ToolFormBuilderDialog.cpp:602
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox distance from the left edge"
msgid "From the left:"
msgstr "距左边缘:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:977
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox distance from the top edge"
msgid "From the top:"
msgstr "距上边缘:"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:985
#, kde-format
msgid "The part to keep, as fractions of the stored picture measured from its top-left corner. What is cut away leaves the file, and what is kept stays exactly where it was on the page rather than being stretched over the old area."
msgstr "要保留的部分，以存储图片左上角起算的比例表示。裁掉的部分会从文件中消失，保留的部分仍精确停留在页面上原来的位置，而不会被拉伸到原来的整个区域。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:992
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Crop the Picture"
msgstr "裁剪图片"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1041
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing is set to change, so the picture would come out as it went in."
msgstr "没有设置任何要改变的项目，图片会原样输出。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1054 src/cli/CommandsImages.cpp:689
#, kde-format
msgid "Worked over the pixels of %1 on page %2; it keeps its place and its size."
msgstr "已处理第 %2 页上 %1 的像素；它的位置和大小保持不变。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1079
#, kde-format
msgid "The part to keep has to lie inside the picture, as fractions between 0 and 1."
msgstr "要保留的部分必须位于图片之内，取值为 0 到 1 之间的比例。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1085
#, kde-format
msgid "That keeps the whole picture, so there is nothing to cut away."
msgstr "这样会保留整张图片，没有任何内容需要裁掉。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1098 src/cli/CommandsImages.cpp:739
#, kde-format
msgid "Cropped %1 on page %2. The part cut away has left the file."
msgstr "已裁剪第 %2 页上的 %1。裁掉的部分已从文件中消失。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1113
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Pictures the file stores twice"
msgstr "文件中存储了两份的图片"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1114
#, kde-format
msgid "A logo pasted onto forty pages is often forty copies of the same bytes. Identical pictures are merged into one object, and every page that drew a copy draws the survivor instead, so the pages come out looking exactly as they did."
msgstr "贴在四十个页面上的同一个徽标，往往就是同一批字节的四十份副本。完全相同的图片会合并为一个对象，原先绘制副本的每个页面改为绘制保留下来的那一个，因此各页面看上去完全和原来一样。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1120
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Merge the Duplicates"
msgstr "合并重复图片"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1126
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "What working on pictures cannot promise"
msgstr "图片处理无法保证的事"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1162
#, kde-format
msgid "No picture is stored more than once, so the result is a copy of the original."
msgstr "没有任何图片被重复存储，因此结果只是原文件的一份副本。"

#: src/ui/ToolImagesDialog.cpp:1166
#, kde-format
msgid "Merged one duplicate into the picture it repeated, freeing %2."
msgid_plural "Merged %1 duplicates into the pictures they repeated, freeing %2."
msgstr[0] "已把 %1 张重复图片合并到它们所重复的图片中，释放了 %2。"

#: src/ui/FormEditor.cpp:56
#, kde-format
