#: src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:393
#, kde-format
msgid "Text and vector colour is rewritten operator by operator, which is exact: every byte that is not a colour comes out untouched. Only pictures have their pixels converted."
msgstr "文本和矢量图形的颜色会逐个操作符重写，这样是精确的：凡是不属于颜色的字节都原样输出。只有图片的像素会被转换。"

#: src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:397
#, kde-format
msgid "This build converts into CMYK itself, through the profile, in place. The page selection is honoured and the text is not rasterised."
msgstr "此版本可以通过配置文件自行就地转换为 CMYK。所选的页面范围有效，文本不会被光栅化。"

#: src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:400
#, kde-format
msgid "This build has no colour management, so Ghostscript converts the whole document. The page selection cannot be honoured on that route, and the result is a rewritten file rather than an edited one."
msgstr "此版本没有颜色管理功能，因此由 Ghostscript 转换整个文档。走这条路径无法照顾所选的页面范围，得到的是一个重写过的文件，而不是编辑过的文件。"

