#: src/ui/ToolColourDialog.cpp:539
#, kde-format
msgid "A printer plates by name, so pointing two inks at the same new name is how they are merged onto one plate. Dissolving uses the tint transform the document already carries, so it needs no profile and is exact arithmetic."
msgstr "印刷厂按名称分版，因此把两种油墨指向同一个新名称，就是把它们合并到一块印版上。分解使用文档本身携带的着色转换函数，因此不需要配置文件，是精确的算术运算。"

