#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:160
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info an object the engine cannot transform at all"
msgid "One object cannot be moved: its placement is flattened into the page and cannot be reversed arithmetically."
msgid_plural "%1 objects cannot be moved: their placement is flattened into the page and cannot be reversed arithmetically."
msgstr[0] "%1个对象无法移动：它们在页面中的位置已被平面化，无法通过计算还原。"

#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:170
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info why one waiting change has taken the place of another"
msgid "The page is rewritten in a single pass, so an object carries one change at a time. What was waiting on it has been dropped."
msgstr "页面只重写一遍，因此一个对象一次只能带有一项更改。原先等待写入的更改已被放弃。"

#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 is the kind of object, such as Shape or Drawing"
msgid "%1 was left out of the copy. The engine writes text, pictures and simple shapes onto a page; it cannot build drawing operators it did not write itself, so there is nothing to paste it from."
msgstr "%1未被复制。引擎可以向页面写入文本、图片和简单形状，但它无法构建并非由自己写入的绘图运算符，因此没有可供粘贴的内容。"

#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:185
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info what a pasted line of text loses"
msgid "Copied text is set again in a standard font. The page's own font stays with the letters that were already on it, so the copy will not match them exactly."
msgstr "复制的文本会以标准字体重新排版。页面自身的字体仍留在原有的字符上，因此副本不会与它们完全一致。"

#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:192
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info characters that could not be read back off the page"
msgid "Some characters could not be read back from the page and were left out of the copy. This happens where a font gives no way of telling which letter a code stands for."
msgstr "有些字符无法从页面中读回，因此未包含在副本内。当某种字体无法说明某个编码代表哪个字符时，就会出现这种情况。"

#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:199
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info why the stacking order cannot be changed"
msgid "What lies on top of what cannot be changed yet. It would mean moving whole blocks of drawing operators, which is only safe when each block is properly enclosed, and on a real page they often are not."
msgstr "对象之间的上下层叠顺序暂时还无法更改。更改它意味着移动整块绘图运算符，只有当每个块都被正确闭合时这样做才安全，而实际的页面往往并非如此。"

