msgstr "“%1”本身已是一个字段，不能再容纳其他字段。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:1023 src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:1030
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” cannot be written to."
msgstr "无法写入“%1”。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:1251
#, kde-format
msgid "This is a JavaScript action, which is how every PDF form does it and which PDF/A forbids outright. A document that has to be archived cannot carry it."
msgstr "这是一个 JavaScript 动作，所有 PDF 表单都用它来实现，而 PDF/A 完全禁止它。需要归档的文档不能包含它。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:1253
#, kde-format
msgid "Readers other than Acrobat vary in how much of this they run, and several run none of it. Treat the behaviour as a convenience, and never as a guarantee that what arrives back is valid."
msgstr "除 Acrobat 之外的阅读器对这部分的执行程度各不相同，有些完全不执行。请把这种行为视为一种便利，而绝不要视为对回传数据有效性的保证。"

