msgstr "“%1”有标题行，但下面没有数据。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2233
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not a kind of data file this can read. Use .fdf, .xfdf or .csv."
msgstr "“%1”不是可读取的数据文件类型。请使用 .fdf、.xfdf 或 .csv。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2240
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” holds no field values."
msgstr "“%1”中没有字段值。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2273
#, kde-format
msgid "There are no documents to collect."
msgstr "没有要收集的文档。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2304
#, kde-format
msgid "None of these documents has a form."
msgstr "这些文档都没有表单。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2310
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:column the file a row of form answers came from"
msgid "Document"
msgstr "文档"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2329
#, kde-format
msgid "Every field is drawn with a border, a background and, for a tick box, its tick, because a field with no drawing of its own is invisible in about half the readers in use."
msgstr "每个字段都会绘制边框和背景，复选框还会绘制它的勾选标记，因为没有自身外观的字段在大约一半的常用阅读器中是不可见的。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2331
#, kde-format
msgid "A font size of zero means the reader fits the text to the box. That is legal and widely honoured, but the size drawn here is our own guess at the same answer, so the two can differ slightly."
msgstr "字体大小为零表示由阅读器把文本自动适配到框内。这是合法的做法，也被广泛支持，但这里绘制时使用的大小只是我们对同一结果的估算，因此两者可能略有出入。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2333
#, kde-format
msgid "Only the fourteen fonts every reader already knows can be used. A field in a font of your own would need that font embedding, which is a separate job."
msgstr "只能使用所有阅读器都已内置的十四种字体。使用自有字体的字段需要嵌入该字体，那是另一项单独的工作。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2335
#, kde-format
msgid "Formatting, validation and calculation are JavaScript, which PDF/A forbids and which several readers do not run at all."
msgstr "格式化、验证和计算都是 JavaScript，PDF/A 禁止使用它，而且有些阅读器根本不执行它。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2337
#, kde-format
msgid "A document with an XFA form is refused rather than added to, because the result would behave differently in every reader."
msgstr "带有 XFA 表单的文档会被拒绝，而不会被添加内容，因为其结果在各个阅读器中表现不一。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2339
#, kde-format
msgid "A field can be renamed but not moved into another group, since anything in the document referring to it by name would then be pointing at nothing."
msgstr "字段可以重命名，但不能移入其他分组，因为文档中按名称引用它的内容随后会指向空处。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2341
#, kde-format
msgid "Data files are read as a flat list of names and values. A file that nests fields, or carries appearances and pages of its own, gives up only its values."
msgstr "数据文件按名称和值的扁平列表读取。若文件中嵌套了字段，或带有自己的外观和页面，则只会取出其中的值。"

#: src/core/FormBuilder.cpp:2343
#, kde-format
msgid "Signature fields are created empty and ready to be signed; signing itself is a separate job."
msgstr "签名字段创建时为空，可供随后签名；签名本身是另一项单独的工作。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:154
#, kde-format
msgid "On page %1 the %2 does not fit inside the %3. Every box has to lie within the one around it."
msgstr "在第 %1 页上，%2 无法容纳于 %3 之内。每个框都必须位于包围它的框之内。"

