#, kde-format
msgid "The document has no pages."
msgstr "此文档没有页面。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:927
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the pages has a usable size."
msgstr "所有页面都没有可用的大小。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:945
#, kde-format
msgid "There are no pages to split."
msgstr "没有要拆分的页面。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:951
#, kde-format
msgid "The split has to fall between a twentieth and nineteen twentieths of the page."
msgstr "拆分位置必须落在页面的二十分之一到二十分之十九之间。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1039
#, kde-format
msgid "The overlay document has no pages."
msgstr "叠加层文档没有页面。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1122
#, kde-format
msgid "No printer's marks were asked for."
msgstr "未要求添加任何印刷标记。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1252
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Printer's mark identifying a proof: file, page, and time of output"
msgid "%1 · page %2 of %3 · %4"
msgstr "%1 · 第 %2 页，共 %3 页 · %4"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1283
#, kde-format
msgid "The sheet size has to be at least one point in each direction."
msgstr "纸张大小在每个方向上至少要有一个点。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1290
#, kde-format
msgid "The overlap has to be less than half the sheet, or the tiles never advance."
msgstr "重叠必须小于纸张的一半，否则平铺的分块永远无法推进。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1381
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Label on one sheet of a tiled poster"
msgid "Sheet %1 of %2, column %3, row %4"
msgstr "第 %1 张，共 %2 张，第 %3 列，第 %4 行"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1404
#, kde-format
msgid "No page-numbering ranges were given."
msgstr "未指定页码编号范围。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1421
#, kde-format
msgid "A numbering range starts at page %1, which this document does not have."
msgstr "有一个编号范围从第 %1 页开始，而此文档没有该页。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1428
#, kde-format
msgid "Page numbering has to start at one or more."
msgstr "页码编号必须从一或更大的数开始。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1525
#, kde-format
msgid "There are no pages to remove."
msgstr "没有要移除的页面。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1546
#, kde-format
msgid "Removing those pages would leave no document at all."
msgstr "移除这些页面后将不会剩下任何文档。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1567
#, kde-format
msgid "A saddle-stitched booklet needs at least four pages."
msgstr "骑马订小册子至少需要四页。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1609
#, kde-format
msgid "A blank page is found by reading the page's instructions, not by looking at it. A page that paints white over white, or one whose only content is an annotation, counts as painted and is not reported."
msgstr "空白页是通过读取页面的绘制指令来判断的，而不是通过观察外观。在白色上再涂白色的页面，或者唯一内容是批注的页面，都算作有绘制内容，不会被报告出来。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1611
#, kde-format
msgid "Resizing scales the page's content as a whole. Line widths, hairlines and font sizes scale with it, so a page reduced far enough can end up with rules too fine for a press to hold."
msgstr "调整大小会整体缩放页面内容。线条宽度、细线和字体大小都会随之缩放，因此缩得太小的页面可能出现印刷机无法还原的过细线条。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1613
#, kde-format
msgid "Splitting a page gives each half a window onto the same content. Both halves inherit the same annotations, and an annotation that straddles the cut appears on both."
msgstr "拆分页面会让每一半都成为同一内容上的一个视窗。两半会继承同样的批注，跨越切分线的批注会同时出现在两半上。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1615
#, kde-format
msgid "Printer's marks are drawn in a /Separation /All colour space. A workflow that flattens spot colours before output may convert them to black, which still prints but no longer serves for registration."
msgstr "印刷标记以 /Separation /All 颜色空间绘制。若工作流程在输出前把专色平面化，可能会把它们转换为黑色，这样虽然仍能印出，却不再能用于套准。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1617
#, kde-format
msgid "Marks are placed around the trim box. A document whose trim box is missing gets them around what the page shows instead, which is right for most files and wrong for one that was already imposed."
msgstr "标记放置在裁剪框周围。若文档缺少裁剪框，则改为放置在页面显示范围的周围，这对大多数文件是正确的，但对已经拼版过的文件则不对。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1619
#, kde-format
msgid "Page labels are written as far as the specification describes them. Readers differ in what they show for a range whose style is left out, and this cannot make them agree."
msgstr "页面标签会按照规范所描述的范围写入。对于省略了样式的范围，各个阅读器显示的内容并不一致，这一点无法强求统一。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1621
#, kde-format
msgid "Reordering for binding changes the page order only. Pairing the pages onto sheets and adding the fold is a separate step."
msgstr "为装订重新排序只会改变页面顺序。把页面配对拼到纸张上并添加折页是另一个单独的步骤。"

#: src/core/PageLayout.cpp:1623
#, kde-format
msgid "Overlaying two documents draws one over the other; it does not merge their form fields, and two forms with a field of the same name keep only the base document's."
msgstr "叠加两个文档只是把一个绘制在另一个之上；它不会合并两者的表单字段，若两个表单有同名字段，则只保留基础文档中的那个。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:130 src/core/Preflight.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a font the file does not name"
msgid "an unnamed font"
msgstr "未命名的字体"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:348
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is encrypted. An archive has to be able to open it in fifty years' time, without a password, so PDF/A does not allow that."
msgstr "此文档已加密。归档要求在五十年后仍能不用密码打开它，因此 PDF/A 不允许加密。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid "The document contains scripts, or an action that runs when it is opened. PDF/A allows neither."
msgstr "此文档包含脚本，或包含打开时自动运行的动作。PDF/A 两者都不允许。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgid "The document carries other files inside it. Only PDF/A-3 allows that."
msgstr "此文档内部携带了其他文件。只有 PDF/A-3 允许这样做。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:361
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item separator in a list of font names"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:356
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 font is not embedded (%2), so its text will be set in whatever the reader happens to have instead."
msgid_plural "%1 fonts are not embedded (%2), so their text will be set in whatever the reader happens to have instead."
msgstr[0] "有 %1 种字体未嵌入 (%2)，因此其文本将改用阅读器上碰巧存在的字体来显示。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:363 src/core/Preflight.cpp:1592
#, kde-format
msgid "The document has no output intent, so nothing in it says what its colours are meant to look like."
msgstr "此文档没有输出意图，因此其中没有任何内容说明它的颜色应当呈现什么样子。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:373
#, kde-format
msgid "The password protection was removed, because PDF/A does not allow it."
msgstr "已移除密码保护，因为 PDF/A 不允许密码保护。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:375
#, kde-format
msgid "Scripts and actions that run on their own were removed."
msgstr "已移除脚本以及会自动运行的动作。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:377
#, kde-format
msgid "The files carried inside the document were dropped. Convert to PDF/A-3 if they matter."
msgstr "已丢弃文档内部携带的文件。如果这些文件很重要，请转换为 PDF/A-3。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:379
#, kde-format
msgid "The fonts were embedded, so the text keeps its shape on a machine that does not have them."
msgstr "已嵌入字体，因此在没有这些字体的机器上，文本仍能保持原有字形。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:381
#, kde-format
msgid "An sRGB output intent was added, so the colours are stated rather than assumed."
msgstr "已添加 sRGB 输出意图，因此颜色是明确声明的，而不是靠推测的。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:558
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item PDF/A level"
msgid "PDF/A-1b (oldest, strictest, accepted everywhere)"
msgstr "PDF/A-1b (最旧、最严格、处处通用)"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:560
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item PDF/A level"
msgid "PDF/A-2b (what most archives ask for)"
msgstr "PDF/A-2b (大多数档案机构的要求)"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:562
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item PDF/A level"
msgid "PDF/A-3b (as PDF/A-2b, but attachments may stay)"
msgstr "PDF/A-3b (与 PDF/A-2b 相同，但可保留附件)"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:570
#, kde-format
msgid "This is not a full validation. It looks for the faults that account for most rejections (encryption, scripts, attachments, fonts that are not embedded, a missing output intent) and nothing else."
msgstr "这不是完整的验证。它只查找导致大多数退回的问题 (加密、脚本、附件、未嵌入的字体、缺少输出意图)，不检查其他内容。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:573
#, kde-format
msgid "A file can pass every check here and still be refused by a strict validator such as veraPDF, which is the tool to reach for when an archive has to sign the file off."
msgstr "文件可能通过这里的每一项检查，却仍被 veraPDF 这类严格的验证工具拒绝；当档案机构必须正式认可文件时，应当使用那类工具。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:575
#, kde-format
msgid "Only what the file says about itself is read. A document claiming PDF/A-2b is taken at its word on that point."
msgstr "这里只读取文件对自身的声明。声称符合 PDF/A-2b 的文档在这一点上会被直接采信。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:606 src/core/Compressor.cpp:208
#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2178 src/core/Convert.cpp:2324
