#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript is not installed, so documents cannot be converted for archiving. Install the “ghostscript” package."
msgstr "未安装 Ghostscript，因此无法转换文档以供归档。请安装“ghostscript”软件包。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:630 src/core/Convert.cpp:2343
#, kde-format
msgid "The colour profile “%1” does not exist."
msgstr "颜色配置文件“%1”不存在。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:638
#, kde-format
msgid "No sRGB colour profile was found on this system, so Ghostscript's built-in default was used. The file will have no output intent, which a strict check may object to. Installing the “icc-profiles-free” package fixes it."
msgstr "在此系统上未找到 sRGB 颜色配置文件，因此使用了 Ghostscript 的内置默认值。该文件将没有输出意图，严格检查可能会对此提出异议。安装“icc-profiles-free”软件包即可解决。"

#: src/core/Archival.cpp:646 src/core/Convert.cpp:2373
#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2607
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not create a temporary directory."
msgstr "无法创建临时目录。"

