#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:879
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文本"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:881
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Picture"
msgstr "图片"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:883
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形状"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:885
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Drawing"
msgstr "绘图"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:887
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Gradient"
msgstr "渐变"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:889
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item kind of page object"
msgid "Inline picture"
msgstr "内嵌图片"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:897
#, kde-format
msgid "Objects inside an embedded drawing are handled as one unit. There is no way in without dissolving the drawing first."
msgstr "嵌入绘图内部的对象会作为一个整体处理。除非先把该绘图拆解，否则无法进入其内部。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:899
#, kde-format
msgid "A shape's outline is approximated so that it can be clicked on. What appears on the page is still drawn by the renderer, exactly as the file says."
msgstr "形状的轮廓经过近似处理，以便能够点击选中。页面上呈现的内容仍由渲染器绘制，完全依照文件的描述。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:901
#, kde-format
msgid "Text is one object per drawing operation, which is usually a line rather than a paragraph."
msgstr "文本按每次绘制操作算作一个对象，这通常是一行而不是一段。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:902
#, kde-format
msgid "Clipping is followed only as far as a rectangle. An object clipped to an unusual shape reports a slightly larger boundary than it fills."
msgstr "裁剪只按矩形处理。被裁剪成不规则形状的对象所报告的边界，会略大于它实际填充的范围。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:918
#, kde-format
msgid "There is nothing to change."
msgstr "没有要更改的内容。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:1019
#, kde-format
msgid "A moved or restyled object is wrapped in the change rather than rewritten, so everything else on the page keeps its bytes."
msgstr "被移动或改变样式的对象是用更改包裹起来的，而不是被重写，因此页面上的其他内容都保持原有字节不变。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:1021
#, kde-format
msgid "Changing the stacking order is not offered yet. It would mean reordering operator blocks, which is only safe when each one is properly enclosed."
msgstr "尚未提供更改叠放顺序的功能。那需要重新排列操作符块，只有在每个块都正确闭合时才是安全的。"

#: src/core/PageObjects.cpp:1023
#, kde-format
msgid "Inserted text uses one of the standard fonts and can carry only the characters those hold."
msgstr "插入的文本使用标准字体之一，只能包含这些字体所含的字符。"

