msgstr "无法替换“%1”：%2"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:531
#, kde-format
msgid "The page does not say which font this text uses."
msgstr "页面没有说明此文本使用的是哪种字体。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:574
#, kde-format
msgid "This font does not say which characters it holds, so replacing its text would produce the wrong letters."
msgstr "此字体没有说明它包含哪些字符，因此替换其文本会得到错误的文字。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1040
#, kde-format
msgid "Some of this text uses characters the font does not explain, so it cannot be read back reliably."
msgstr "此文本中有部分字符是该字体未加说明的，因此无法可靠地读回。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1098
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” was left as it was: the face asked for does not contain %2."
msgstr "“%1”保持原样：所请求的字体不包含 %2。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1100
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” was left as it was: this document's font does not contain %2."
msgstr "“%1”保持原样：此文档的字体不包含 %2。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1115
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is longer than the space it replaces and reaches past it."
msgstr "“%1”比它所替换的空间更长，超出了该范围。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1221
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 is a font family, %2 the reason it could not be used"
msgid "The text keeps the face it had: “%1” could not be put into this document. %2"
msgstr "文本保持原有字体：无法把“%1”放入此文档。%2"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1288
#, kde-format
msgid "There is no text to change."
msgstr "没有要更改的文本。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1314
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the text to change is on a page of this document."
msgstr "要更改的文本都不在此文档的页面上。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1379
#, kde-format
msgid "Text is replaced in the page's own font, so the result matches everything around it."
msgstr "文本以页面自身的字体替换，因此结果与周围的内容相协调。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1380
#, kde-format
msgid "A replacement that is too wide for its space is squeezed to fit, so that it does not run into what sits beside it. A shorter one simply makes the line shorter."
msgstr "过宽而放不下的替换文本会被压缩以适应空间，以免撞上旁边的内容。较短的替换文本则只会让这一行变短。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1382
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing on other lines moves, because a PDF does not record which line follows which."
msgstr "其他行上的内容不会移动，因为 PDF 并不记录行与行之间的先后关系。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1383
#, kde-format
msgid "A font embedded in a document usually carries only the characters that document used. Asking for a character it does not hold is refused rather than drawn wrongly."
msgstr "嵌入文档中的字体通常只包含该文档用到的字符。请求它没有的字符会被拒绝，而不是错误地画出来。"

#: src/core/TextEdit.cpp:1385
#, kde-format
msgid "Text drawn inside an embedded drawing, and text that is part of a scanned picture, cannot be changed this way."
msgstr "绘制在嵌入绘图内部的文本，以及属于扫描图片一部分的文本，无法用这种方式更改。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:222
#, kde-format
msgid "The character “%1” is outside WinAnsi, which is all the standard fonts can write, and was left out."
msgstr "字符“%1”超出了 WinAnsi 的范围，而标准字体只能写出 WinAnsi 之内的字符，因此该字符已被略过。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:232
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is wider than the column and had to be broken across lines."
msgstr "“%1”比栏宽更宽，只能断成多行。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:240
#, kde-format
msgid "Something is taller than the column holding it and runs past the margin."
msgstr "有内容比容纳它的栏更高，超出了页边距。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1348
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot write “%1”: %2"
msgstr "无法写入“%1”：%2"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1890
#, kde-format
msgid "No file to write to was given."
msgstr "未指定要写入的文件。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1896
#, kde-format
msgid "The type size has to be greater than zero."
msgstr "字号必须大于零。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1902
#, kde-format
msgid "A page smaller than an inch square cannot hold text."
msgstr "小于一平方英寸的页面无法容纳文本。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1914
#, kde-format
msgid "The margins and columns leave no room for text on a page this size."
msgstr "在这种大小的页面上，页边距和分栏没有为文本留下空间。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1948
#, kde-format
msgid "There is no text to lay out."
msgstr "没有要排版的文本。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:1999
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot read “%1”."
msgstr "无法读取“%1”。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2030
#, kde-format
msgid "Only the fourteen standard fonts are used, so the alphabet is the one WinAnsi covers: western Europe. Greek, Cyrillic, Hebrew, Arabic and CJK need an embedded font, and are reported rather than drawn."
msgstr "只会使用十四种标准字体，因此可用的字符就是 WinAnsi 所覆盖的西欧字符。希腊文、西里尔文、希伯来文、阿拉伯文和中日韩文字需要嵌入字体，只会被报告出来而不会绘制。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2033
#, kde-format
msgid "Lines are broken one at a time from left to right rather than by balancing a whole paragraph at once, so the spacing is even but not the best possible."
msgstr "换行是从左到右逐行断开的，而不是一次性对整段进行均衡，因此间距虽然匀称，但并非最佳。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2035
#, kde-format
msgid "Hyphenation follows a spelling pattern rather than a dictionary, and stays off unless it is asked for."
msgstr "断词依据拼写规则而不是词典，并且除非明确要求，否则保持关闭。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2037
#, kde-format
msgid "Pictures are not drawn. A Markdown image contributes its description in italics, because a caption is more use than an empty frame."
msgstr "不会绘制图片。Markdown 图片会以斜体给出它的描述文字，因为说明文字比一个空框更有用。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2039
#, kde-format
msgid "Tables are a plain ruled grid: no merged cells, no heading repeated on the following page, and a row is never split across pages."
msgstr "表格只是简单的网格线：没有合并单元格，标题行不会在下一页重复，一行也永远不会跨页拆分。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2041
#, kde-format
msgid "Footnotes, cross-references, an index and a table of contents are not built; Markdown that describes them is set as ordinary text."
msgstr "不会生成脚注、交叉引用、索引和目录；描述它们的 Markdown 会按普通文本排版。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2043
#, kde-format
msgid "Headers and footers are centred and hold one line, so the page number sits in the middle rather than at the outer edge."
msgstr "页眉和页脚居中且只占一行，因此页码位于中间，而不是靠外侧边缘。"

#: src/core/Typeset.cpp:2045
#, kde-format
msgid "Text runs from top to bottom and left to right; right-to-left scripts are not laid out."
msgstr "文本自上而下、自左向右排列；不会排版从右向左书写的文字。"

#: src/core/Splitter.cpp:107
#, kde-format
msgid "The document has no pages to split."
msgstr "此文档没有可拆分的页面。"

#: src/core/Splitter.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid "No page ranges were given."
msgstr "未指定页面范围。"

#: src/core/Splitter.cpp:154 src/cli/main.cpp:245
#, kde-format
msgid "This document has no bookmarks to split on."
msgstr "此文档没有可作为拆分依据的书签。"

#: src/core/Splitter.cpp:176
#, kde-format
msgid "The maximum file size must be greater than zero."
msgstr "最大文件大小必须大于零。"

#: src/core/Splitter.cpp:212
#, kde-format
msgid "The settings produce no files."
msgstr "当前设置不会生成任何文件。"

#: src/core/Overlay.cpp:202 src/core/Overlay.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgid "There is nothing to stamp."
msgstr "没有可加盖图章的内容。"

#: src/core/Overlay.cpp:261
#, kde-format
msgid "The stamp image could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取图章图片。"

#: src/core/Overlay.cpp:396
#, kde-format
msgid "The watermark text is empty."
msgstr "水印文本为空。"

#: src/core/PdfFile.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid "The file does not quite follow the PDF specification in one place. It was read anyway, and the result should be sound."
msgid_plural "The file does not quite follow the PDF specification in %1 places. It was read anyway, and the result should be sound."
msgstr[0] "该文件有 %1 处未完全遵循 PDF 规范。它仍已被读取，结果应当无误。"

#: src/core/Encryption.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid "A password is required."
msgstr "需要密码。"

#: src/core/Encryption.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” could not be unlocked: %2"
msgstr "无法解锁“%1”：%2"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:374
#, kde-format
msgid "This is not a TrueType or OpenType font file."
msgstr "这不是 TrueType 或 OpenType 字体文件。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:394 src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:725
#, kde-format
msgid "This font file is missing the tables that describe it."
msgstr "此字体文件缺少描述它的表。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:406
#, kde-format
msgid "This font file contains no glyphs."
msgstr "此字体文件不包含任何字形。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:441
#, kde-format
msgid "This font file has no outlines that can be copied."
msgstr "此字体文件没有可以复制的字形轮廓。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1138
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's licence forbids embedding it in a document."
msgstr "此字体的许可证禁止把它嵌入文档。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1140
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's licence allows embedding for viewing and printing only, not for editing."
msgstr "此字体的许可证只允许为查看和打印而嵌入，不允许为编辑而嵌入。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1143
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's licence forbids embedding part of it, so the whole font would have to travel with the document."
msgstr "此字体的许可证禁止只嵌入其中一部分，因此整个字体都必须随文档一同分发。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1147
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's licence allows only its bitmaps to be embedded, not its outlines."
msgstr "此字体的许可证只允许嵌入其位图，不允许嵌入其轮廓。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1616 src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2142
#, kde-format
msgid "The font file %1 cannot be read."
msgstr "无法读取字体文件 %1。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1681
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is a composite font, whose codes are glyph numbers with no meaning outside the font programme itself. Putting another face behind those numbers would need every code on every page rewritten, so it was left alone."
msgstr "“%1”是复合字体，它的编码是字形编号，离开字体程序本身就没有任何意义。要在这些编号背后换上另一种字体，就必须重写每一页上的每个编码，因此未作改动。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1688
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” draws its glyphs with the document's own operators, so there is no font programme to supply."
msgstr "“%1”使用文档自身的操作符绘制字形，因此没有可提供的字体程序。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1696
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing in this document says what “%1”'s character codes mean, so no substitute could be given the same meaning. It was left alone."
msgstr "本文档中没有任何信息说明“%1”的字符编码代表什么，因此无法让替代字体具有相同的含义。它未作改动。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1725
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing on this system could stand in for “%1”. %2"
msgstr "本系统上没有任何字体可以替代“%1”。%2"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1787
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” holds none of the characters “%2” is used for, so substituting it would have emptied the page. It was left alone."
msgstr "“%1”不包含“%2”所用的任何字符，替换后页面会变成空白。因此未作改动。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1799
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1”'s outlines are in a form this cannot read."
msgstr "“%1”的轮廓采用了此处无法读取的格式。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1803 src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2257
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” stores its outlines in compact form, which cannot be cut down, so the whole font was embedded and the document grew by %2 kB."
msgstr "“%1”以紧凑格式存储轮廓，无法进行子集化，因此嵌入了整个字体，文档增大了 %2 kB。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1916
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” cannot draw %2, so those codes now show nothing. The text is still there and still copyable; it is the shapes that are missing."
msgstr "“%1”无法绘制 %2，因此这些编码现在不显示任何内容。文本仍然存在，也仍可复制，缺少的只是字形形状。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1923
#, kde-format
msgid "“%2” names one of its codes %3, which says nothing about what that code draws. It was left out rather than given a letter on a guess, so that code now shows nothing."
msgid_plural "“%2” names %1 of its codes with glyph names that say nothing about what they draw (%3). They were left out rather than given letters on a guess, so those codes now show nothing."
msgstr[0] "“%2”有 %1 个编码所用的字形名称并未说明它们绘制的是什么（%3）。与其凭猜测为它们指定字母，不如将其排除在外，因此这些编码现在不显示任何内容。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1932
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” stated no widths of its own, as one of the standard fourteen may. The standard metrics were written into the document so that the spacing survives being made explicit."
msgstr "“%1”没有声明自己的字符宽度，标准十四种字体之一可以这样做。标准度量已写入文档，以便在宽度显式化之后间距保持不变。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1938
#, kde-format
msgid "“%2” stated no widths of its own, as one of the standard fourteen may, so the standard metrics were written into the document. One code has no width in those tables and was given the substitute's own advance instead."
msgid_plural "“%2” stated no widths of its own, as one of the standard fourteen may, so the standard metrics were written into the document. %1 codes have no width in those tables (the dashes, the ellipsis, the letters with no plain form) and were given the substitute's own advances instead."
msgstr[0] "“%2”没有声明自己的字符宽度，标准十四种字体之一可以这样做，因此标准度量已写入文档。有 %1 个编码在这些表格中没有宽度（各种短横线、省略号、没有基本形式的字母），它们改用了替代字体自身的步进宽度。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1948
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” states no widths and is not one of the standard fourteen, so how wide its characters were meant to be is not recorded anywhere. The substitute's own widths were written instead, and lines that depended on the old spacing will move."
msgstr "“%1”没有声明宽度，也不属于标准十四种字体，因此它的字符原本应有多宽在任何地方都没有记录。文档中改用了替代字体自身的宽度，依赖原有间距的行会发生位移。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:1954
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not metrically the same font as “%2”: the widest character differs by %3 thousandths of the em. Nothing moves, because the document's own widths still decide that, but the letters no longer quite fill the space kept for them."
msgstr "“%1”与“%2”在度量上并不是同一种字体：最宽的字符相差 %3 个千分之一 em。页面上的内容不会移动，因为位置仍由文档自身的宽度决定，但字母不再恰好填满为它们保留的空间。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2120
#, kde-format
msgid "No characters were asked for, so there is nothing to embed."
msgstr "没有请求任何字符，因此没有可嵌入的内容。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2126
#, kde-format
msgid "This page has no resources for a font to be added to."
msgstr "此页面没有可供添加字体的资源。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2162
#, kde-format
msgid "No bold cut of “%1” is installed, so the ordinary one was embedded."
msgstr "系统中没有安装“%1”的粗体版本，因此嵌入了常规版本。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2166
#, kde-format
msgid "No italic cut of “%1” is installed, so the upright one was embedded."
msgstr "系统中没有安装“%1”的斜体版本，因此嵌入了直立版本。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2193
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” holds none of the characters asked for."
msgstr "“%1”不包含所请求的任何字符。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2198
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” does not hold %2, so those were left out."
msgstr "“%1”不包含 %2，因此这些字符被排除在外。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2230
#, kde-format
msgid "A font of this kind can show at most 255 different characters, and more than that were asked for."
msgstr "这类字体最多只能显示 255 个不同的字符，而请求的字符数超过了这个上限。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2252
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's outlines are in a form this cannot read."
msgstr "此字体的轮廓采用了此处无法读取的格式。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2260
#, kde-format
msgid "A font embedded whole in this form is addressed by glyph name, so a character with no standard name may not appear."
msgstr "以这种格式整体嵌入的字体是按字形名称寻址的，因此没有标准名称的字符可能不会显示出来。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2398
#, kde-format
msgid "This document has no pages for a font to be added to."
msgstr "此文档没有可供添加字体的页面。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2471
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the fonts this document is missing could be given a face from this system."
msgstr "本系统上没有任何字体可以替代此文档所缺的字体。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2530
#, kde-format
msgid "No font in this document is called “%1”. “fonts list” says what it does use."
msgstr "此文档中没有名为“%1”的字体。“fonts list”会列出它实际使用的字体。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2532
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” was found but could not be replaced with “%2”."
msgstr "找到了“%1”，但无法将它替换为“%2”。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2566
#, kde-format
msgid "This font's outlines are in compact form, which cannot be cut down."
msgstr "此字体的轮廓采用紧凑格式，无法进行子集化。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2589
#, kde-format
msgid "This font programme says nothing about which glyph draws which character, so what it holds cannot be worked out from the outside."
msgstr "此字体程序没有说明哪个字形绘制哪个字符，因此无法从外部推断出它包含哪些内容。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2608
#, kde-format
msgid "Only the characters asked for go into the document, which is what keeps the file small. Text added later in the same font needs its characters embedded too."
msgstr "只有请求的字符会写入文档，这正是文件保持较小的原因。之后用同一字体添加的文本，也需要嵌入它自己的字符。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2610
#, kde-format
msgid "A font added this way can hold 255 different characters at most. A document needing more than that needs one font per 255, which this does not yet arrange."
msgstr "以这种方式添加的字体最多可容纳 255 个不同的字符。需要更多字符的文档必须每 255 个字符使用一种字体，而这一点目前尚未实现。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2612
#, kde-format
msgid "Characters outside the basic multilingual plane (most emoji, and the rarer Chinese) cannot be embedded."
msgstr "基本多文种平面以外的字符（大多数表情符号，以及较生僻的汉字）无法嵌入。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2614
#, kde-format
msgid "A font whose outlines are in compact form is embedded whole rather than cut down, because cutting that format down properly is a second piece of work. The file is larger and the reason is reported."
msgstr "轮廓采用紧凑格式的字体会整体嵌入，而不做子集化，因为正确地对该格式进行子集化是另一项工作。文件会因此变大，并且会报告原因。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2616
#, kde-format
msgid "Kerning is not carried over: the characters are spaced by their own widths, which is what a PDF records anyway."
msgstr "字偶间距不会保留：字符按各自的宽度排布，而 PDF 本来记录的就是这个宽度。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2618
#, kde-format
msgid "What a font's licence permits is read from the font and reported, never enforced. Whether a licence covers what is being done with it is not something a program can know."
msgstr "字体许可证允许什么，只会从字体中读取并报告，绝不会强制执行。许可证是否涵盖当前的用途，不是程序能够判断的事情。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2620
#, kde-format
msgid "Substituting a face for a font the document is missing keeps every character code and every stated width, so nothing on the page moves. What it cannot keep is the shapes: a substitute is a different typeface, and only the metrically compatible ones fill the same space."
msgstr "为文档缺失的字体指定替代字体时，所有字符编码和已声明的宽度都会保留，因此页面上的内容不会移动。无法保留的是字形形状：替代字体是另一种字体，只有度量兼容的字体才会占据同样的空间。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2623
#, kde-format
msgid "A composite font (the kind used for Chinese, and by most modern producers for everything) cannot be substituted or replaced, because its codes are glyph numbers meaningful only inside the font programme that is missing. Those are named rather than guessed at."
msgstr "复合字体（中文所用的那种，也是大多数现代生成器普遍使用的那种）无法替代或替换，因为它的编码是字形编号，只在缺失的那个字体程序内部才有意义。这类字体只会被列出名称，而不会去猜测。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2626
#, kde-format
msgid "A font the document refers to without saying what its codes mean, and which is not one of the standard fourteen, is left alone: there is no honest way to give a substitute the same meaning."
msgstr "如果文档引用了某种字体却没有说明它的编码代表什么，而它又不属于标准十四种字体，那么这种字体不会被改动：没有任何可靠的办法让替代字体具有相同的含义。"

#: src/core/FontEmbedder.cpp:2628
#, kde-format
msgid "Only fonts a page can reach are dealt with. A font used solely by a document's interactive form resources is not."
msgstr "只处理页面能够访问到的字体。仅由文档交互式表单资源使用的字体不在处理范围内。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1318
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not write all of “%1”."
msgstr "无法完整写入“%1”。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1855
#, kde-format
msgid "The document keeps its objects in compressed object streams, which no reader older than PDF %1 can unpack."
msgstr "文档将它的对象保存在压缩对象流中，早于 PDF %1 的阅读器无法解开这些流。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1872
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is encrypted with AES-256, which needs PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档使用 AES-256 加密，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1876
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is encrypted with AES-128, which needs PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档使用 AES-128 加密，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1880
#, kde-format
msgid "The document uses encryption with a longer key than PDF %1 allows."
msgstr "文档使用的加密密钥长度超过了 PDF %1 允许的长度。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1887
#, kde-format
msgid "The document has layers, which need PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档含有图层，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1919
#, kde-format
msgid "The document uses transparency, which needs PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档使用了透明度，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1923
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture in the document is compressed with JBIG2, which needs PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档中有图片使用 JBIG2 压缩，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:1929
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture in the document is compressed with JPEG 2000, which needs PDF %1 or newer."
msgstr "文档中有图片使用 JPEG 2000 压缩，这需要 PDF %1 或更高版本。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2208
#, kde-format
msgid "Neither pdftocairo nor Ghostscript is installed, so pages cannot be saved as SVG. Install the “poppler-utils” package."
msgstr "系统既未安装 pdftocairo，也未安装 Ghostscript，因此无法将页面保存为 SVG。请安装“poppler-utils”软件包。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2241
#, kde-format
msgid "Saving page %1 as SVG did not finish."
msgstr "将第 %1 页保存为 SVG 的操作没有完成。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2248
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 could not be saved as SVG."
msgstr "无法将第 %1 页保存为 SVG。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2288
#, kde-format
msgid "No table was found in this document. There may be none, or its columns may not line up well enough to be recognised."
msgstr "在此文档中没有找到表格。可能确实没有表格，也可能是各列的对齐程度不足以被识别出来。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2331
#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript is not installed, so documents cannot be prepared for print. Install the “ghostscript” package."
msgstr "系统未安装 Ghostscript，因此无法为印刷准备文档。请安装“ghostscript”软件包。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2352
#, kde-format
msgid "No CMYK printing profile was found on this system, so the file has no output intent and is not yet PDF/X. Install the “icc-profiles-free” package, or name the profile your printer asked for."
msgstr "本系统上没有找到 CMYK 印刷配置文件，因此文件没有输出意图，还不是 PDF/X。请安装“icc-profiles-free”软件包，或者指定印厂要求的配置文件。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2359
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not a colour profile this can read."
msgstr "“%1”不是此处能够读取的颜色配置文件。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2364
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not a CMYK profile. It has been used as the output intent because it was the one asked for, but a printer will expect a CMYK printing condition."
msgstr "“%1”不是 CMYK 配置文件。由于它是指定使用的配置文件，因此仍被用作输出意图，但印厂会期望一个 CMYK 印刷条件。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2437
#, kde-format
msgid "Preparing the document for print took too long and was stopped."
msgstr "为印刷准备文档耗时过长，已被停止。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2452
#, kde-format
msgid "Preparing the document for print produced an empty file."
msgstr "为印刷准备文档时生成了一个空文件。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2474
#, kde-format
msgid "Fonts were embedded, so the printer sets the text in the faces you chose rather than in whatever the press happens to have."
msgstr "字体已嵌入，因此印厂会用您选择的字体来排印文本，而不是用印刷机上碰巧有的字体。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2477
#, kde-format
msgid "An output intent was added from “%1”, so the file states the printing condition its colours are meant for instead of leaving it to be guessed."
msgstr "已根据“%1”添加输出意图，因此文件会说明它的颜色所针对的印刷条件，而不必让人去猜测。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2482
#, kde-format
msgid "Colours were converted to CMYK and transparency was flattened, neither of which PDF/X-1a allows to be left as it was."
msgstr "颜色已转换为 CMYK，透明度已平面化，这两项 PDF/X-1a 都不允许保持原样。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2485
#, kde-format
msgid "Colours were kept device-independent where they already were, which is what PDF/X-3 exists to allow."
msgstr "原本与设备无关的颜色保持了设备无关，这正是 PDF/X-3 所要允许的。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2488
#, kde-format
msgid "Transparency was left live, which is what PDF/X-4 exists to allow."
msgstr "透明度保持为活动状态，这正是 PDF/X-4 所要允许的。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2492
#, kde-format
msgid "Some colours could not be converted for the stated printing condition, so a preflight check may object to them."
msgstr "有些颜色无法按照声明的印刷条件转换，因此印前检查可能会对它们提出问题。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2495
#, kde-format
msgid "The colour conversion is Ghostscript's, not a printer's. A proof is still the only way to know what will come off the press."
msgstr "颜色转换出自 Ghostscript，而不是印厂。要知道印刷机上最终印出什么效果，打样仍然是唯一的办法。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2534
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not a PDF version. It looks like “1.7”."
msgstr "“%1”不是 PDF 版本号。版本号的形式类似“1.7”。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2562
#, kde-format
msgid "This document cannot claim to be PDF %1: it uses features that need at least PDF %2. Lowering the number would only mislead a reader that then meets them."
msgstr "此文档不能声称自己是 PDF %1：它使用了至少需要 PDF %2 的特性。降低版本号只会误导随后遇到这些特性的阅读器。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2571
#, kde-format
msgid "Raising the number from PDF %1 to PDF %2 does not add anything to the document; it only says that a newer reader is expected."
msgstr "把版本号从 PDF %1 提高到 PDF %2 并不会给文档增加任何内容，只是表示需要更新的阅读器。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2600
#, kde-format
msgid "A PDF holds glyphs at coordinates, not sentences. Reading order, paragraphs and columns are worked out from the geometry, which is inference and not extraction."
msgstr "PDF 保存的是位于坐标上的字形，而不是句子。阅读顺序、段落和分栏都是根据几何位置推算出来的，这是推断，而不是提取。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2602
#, kde-format
msgid "Text that is part of a scanned picture is not text and does not come out. Run the page through text recognition first."
msgstr "属于扫描图片一部分的文字并不是文本，无法提取出来。请先对该页面运行文本识别 (OCR)。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2604
#, kde-format
msgid "Two columns are found by the white gutter between them. Three or more columns are found the same way, but a layout with the columns interleaved by hand, or one whose gutter is filled by a picture, will come out in the wrong order."
msgstr "双栏是通过两栏之间的空白栏间距识别的。三栏及以上也用同样的方法识别，但如果版面中的栏是手工交错排列的，或者栏间距被图片填满，提取出来的顺序就会出错。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2607
#, kde-format
msgid "A table is read column by column by the plain-text export, because its columns look exactly like a page's columns. Use the table detection for tables."
msgstr "纯文本导出会逐栏读取表格，因为表格的列看起来和页面的分栏一模一样。处理表格时请使用表格检测。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2609
#, kde-format
msgid "Which paragraph is a heading, which line is a list item and which words are emphasised are all guessed: from size, from leading characters and from the font's own name. A document with no consistent body size, or a font family whose bold face is not called bold, will be guessed wrong."
msgstr "哪一段是标题、哪一行是列表项、哪些词带有强调，全都是根据大小、行首字符和字体自身的名称推测出来的。如果文档的正文大小不一致，或者某个字体族的粗体名称中不含 bold，推测就会出错。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2612
#, kde-format
msgid "A word broken by a hyphen at the end of a line is joined back together when the next line starts in lower case, which is wrong for a compound whose hyphen was real."
msgstr "行末用连字符断开的单词，会在下一行以小写字母开头时重新拼接起来；对于连字符本来就是词的一部分的复合词，这样处理是错的。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2614
#, kde-format
msgid "Pictures are only carried into HTML when the page draws them itself and they are in a format that can be decoded here. Fax and JPEG 2000 pictures, and pictures drawn inside an embedded drawing, are left out."
msgstr "只有页面自身绘制、且格式在此处可以解码的图片才会被带入 HTML。传真格式和 JPEG 2000 图片，以及在嵌入图形内部绘制的图片，都会被略去。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2617
#, kde-format
msgid "Table detection needs every row to have the same number of cells, so a table with cells left empty or merged across columns is found in pieces or not at all."
msgstr "表格检测要求每一行的单元格数量相同，因此含有空单元格或跨列合并单元格的表格，只会被识别出片段，或者完全无法识别。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2619
#, kde-format
msgid "Confidence is a judgement about how table-like the geometry is, not a probability. Check the result before relying on it."
msgstr "置信度是对几何结构在多大程度上像表格的一种判断，而不是概率。请在依赖结果之前先检查一下。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2621
#, kde-format
msgid "PDF/X conversion is Ghostscript's, and this is not a preflight check. A file that comes out of it still has to pass whatever your printer runs."
msgstr "PDF/X 转换由 Ghostscript 完成，这并不是印前检查。转换出来的文件仍然必须通过印厂运行的各项检查。"

#: src/core/Convert.cpp:2623
#, kde-format
msgid "The claimed PDF version is only a claim. Lowering it is refused where the document uses features an older reader would not understand, and raising it adds nothing."
msgstr "声明的 PDF 版本只是一种声明。如果文档使用了旧阅读器无法理解的特性，就会拒绝降低版本号；而提高版本号并不会增加任何内容。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:191
#, kde-format
msgid "The ICC profile “%1” could not be opened."
msgstr "无法打开 ICC 配置文件“%1”。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not a CMYK ICC profile."
msgstr "“%1”不是 CMYK ICC 配置文件。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:218
#, kde-format
msgid "A colour transform could not be built from “%1”."
msgstr "无法根据“%1”建立颜色转换。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:268
#, kde-format
msgid "This build has no colour management, so it cannot convert into CMYK itself."
msgstr "此构建版本不含色彩管理，因此无法自行转换为 CMYK。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:1835
#, kde-format
msgid "A colour space named in a page could not be resolved, so colour set through it was left as it is."
msgstr "页面中指定的某个颜色空间无法解析，因此通过它设置的颜色保持原样。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:1977
#, kde-format
msgid "A colour could not be read back through its own colour space, most likely a separation without a usable tint transform, and was left alone."
msgstr "某个颜色无法通过它自身的颜色空间读回，很可能是没有可用色调转换的分色，因此未作改动。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2042
#, kde-format
msgid "A separation has no tint transform this can evaluate, so it was left as a spot colour."
msgstr "某个分色没有此处能够求值的色调转换，因此保留为专色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2223
#, kde-format
msgid "Inline images are carried across in their original colour; they are rare and small, and rewriting one means rebuilding the operator around it."
msgstr "内联图像会以原有颜色保留下来，它们数量少、体积小，而重写一个内联图像意味着要重建它周围的操作符。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2465
#, kde-format
msgid "A shading pattern paints from its own colour function, which is carried across unchanged. Its colours are not converted."
msgstr "渐变图案用它自身的颜色函数绘制，该函数会原封不动地保留下来。它的颜色不会被转换。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2861
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the pages asked for are in this document."
msgstr "所请求的页面都不在此文档中。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2949
#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript is not installed, so this cannot be measured. Install the “ghostscript” package."
msgstr "系统未安装 Ghostscript，因此无法进行测量。请安装“ghostscript”软件包。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:2967
#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript took too long and was stopped."
msgstr "Ghostscript 耗时过长，已被停止。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3138
#, kde-format
msgid "The document has one inline image, whose colour is not counted here."
msgid_plural "The document has %1 inline images, whose colour is not counted here."
msgstr[0] "文档中有 %1 个内联图像，此处没有统计它们的颜色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3240
#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript converted the whole document, because no ICC profile was available to do it in place. Every page was rewritten, the result is Ghostscript's own conversion rather than a profile you chose, and the file has been rebuilt from end to end rather than edited."
msgstr "由于没有可用的 ICC 配置文件在原位完成转换，Ghostscript 转换了整个文档。每一页都被重写，得到的是 Ghostscript 自己的转换结果，而不是您选择的配置文件的结果，并且文件是从头到尾重建的，而不是就地编辑的。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3274
#, kde-format
msgid "Converting only some pages to CMYK needs an ICC profile, because the only other route is Ghostscript and it rewrites the whole document. Name a CMYK profile, or convert every page."
msgstr "只把部分页面转换为 CMYK 需要 ICC 配置文件，因为另一条路径只有 Ghostscript，而它会重写整个文档。请指定一个 CMYK 配置文件，或者转换全部页面。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3286
#, kde-format
msgid "Colour was converted to CMYK through the ICC profile “%1”."
msgstr "颜色已通过 ICC 配置文件“%1”转换为 CMYK。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3287
#, kde-format
msgid "Grey was written as black ink alone rather than as a four-colour build, which is what a press wants."
msgstr "灰色以单一黑墨写入，而不是四色叠印，这正是印刷机所需要的。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3298
#, kde-format
msgid "CMYK was converted to RGB through the ICC profile “%1”."
msgstr "CMYK 已通过 ICC 配置文件“%1”转换为 RGB。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3300
#, kde-format
msgid "CMYK was converted to RGB with the formula the PDF specification defines. It is predictable and needs no profile, but it is not colour-managed. Name an ICC profile for that."
msgstr "CMYK 已用 PDF 规范定义的公式转换为 RGB。这种方式结果可预期，也不需要配置文件，但它不受色彩管理。若需要色彩管理，请指定一个 ICC 配置文件。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3304
#, kde-format
msgid "Grey was computed with the weighting the PDF specification defines for it, which is exact and needs no profile."
msgstr "灰色用 PDF 规范为它定义的权重计算得出，这种方式精确，也不需要配置文件。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3321
#, kde-format
msgid "One colour operator was rewritten in place, leaving everything else in the page untouched."
msgid_plural "%1 colour operators were rewritten in place, leaving everything else in the pages untouched."
msgstr[0] "已就地重写 %1 个颜色操作符，页面中的其他内容均未改动。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3328
#, kde-format
msgid "One image had its pixels converted and re-encoded."
msgid_plural "%1 images had their pixels converted and re-encoded."
msgstr[0] "%1 张图片的像素已被转换并重新编码。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3332
#, kde-format
msgid "One indexed image had only its palette rewritten, so its pixels and their compression are exactly as they were."
msgid_plural "%1 indexed images had only their palettes rewritten, so their pixels and their compression are exactly as they were."
msgstr[0] "%1 张索引图片只重写了调色板，因此它们的像素和压缩方式完全保持原样。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3339
#, kde-format
msgid "One image could not be decoded and was left in its original colour."
msgid_plural "%1 images could not be decoded and were left in their original colour."
msgstr[0] "%1 张图片无法解码，保留了原有的颜色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3344
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing needed changing: the pages were already in the colour asked for."
msgstr "无需任何改动：这些页面已经是所请求的颜色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3359
#, kde-format
msgid "Both colours have to be valid."
msgstr "两种颜色都必须有效。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3386
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing was asked for: name an ink to rename or one to turn into process colour."
msgstr "没有指定任何操作：请指定要重命名的油墨，或者要转换为印刷色的油墨。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3495
#, kde-format
msgid "The minimum width has to be greater than zero."
msgstr "最小宽度必须大于零。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3541
#, kde-format
msgid "Ink coverage is measured by rendering each page in CMYK, which needs Ghostscript. Install the “ghostscript” package."
msgstr "墨量覆盖率是通过以 CMYK 渲染每一页来测量的，这需要 Ghostscript。请安装“ghostscript”软件包。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3550 src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3624
#, kde-format
msgid "A temporary folder could not be created."
msgstr "无法创建临时文件夹。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3608
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 is not in this document."
msgstr "此文档中没有第 %1 页。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3614
#, kde-format
msgid "A separations preview is produced by Ghostscript. Install the “ghostscript” package."
msgstr "分色预览由 Ghostscript 生成。请安装“ghostscript”软件包。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3646
#, kde-format
msgid "Ghostscript did not produce a readable separation."
msgstr "Ghostscript 没有生成可读取的分色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3690
#, kde-format
msgid "There is no separation called “%1” on page %2."
msgstr "第 %2 页上没有名为“%1”的分色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3701
#, kde-format
msgid "Text and vector colour is rewritten exactly, operator by operator. Everything else in those pages (the glyphs, the paths, the fonts, the structure) comes out untouched."
msgstr "文本和矢量图形的颜色会逐个操作符地精确重写。这些页面中的其他一切（字形、路径、字体、结构）都会原样保留。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3703
#, kde-format
msgid "Conversion into CMYK needs an ICC profile. Without one, Ghostscript converts the whole document instead, which cannot honour a page selection and gives Ghostscript's conversion rather than one you chose."
msgstr "转换为 CMYK 需要 ICC 配置文件。没有配置文件时，改由 Ghostscript 转换整个文档，这样无法遵循页面选择，得到的也是 Ghostscript 的转换结果，而不是您选择的转换。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3706
#, kde-format
msgid "Greyscale and RGB conversions use the arithmetic the PDF specification defines, so they are exact and repeatable, but they are not colour-managed."
msgstr "灰度和 RGB 转换使用 PDF 规范定义的算法，因此精确且可重现，但它们不受色彩管理。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3708
#, kde-format
msgid "Photographs are decoded, converted and re-encoded, so a JPEG loses a little each time. Indexed pictures have only their palette rewritten and lose nothing at all."
msgstr "照片会被解码、转换并重新编码，因此 JPEG 每经过一次都会损失一点。索引图片只重写调色板，完全没有损失。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3710
#, kde-format
msgid "Fax, JPEG 2000 and four-colour JPEG images cannot be decoded here and are left in their original colour rather than guessed at."
msgstr "传真格式、JPEG 2000 和四色 JPEG 图片在此处无法解码，因此保留原有颜色，而不是靠猜测处理。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3712
#, kde-format
msgid "Shading patterns and tiling patterns paint from their own colour functions, which are carried across unchanged."
msgstr "渐变图案和平铺图案用各自的颜色函数绘制，这些函数会原封不动地保留下来。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3714
#, kde-format
msgid "Inline images keep their original colour."
msgstr "内联图像保留它原有的颜色。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3715
#, kde-format
msgid "A colour replaced by name is written in RGB, or in grey when the replacement is a grey and the original was one. Putting an arbitrary colour back into CMYK or into a spot ink would need a profile this has not been given."
msgstr "按名称替换的颜色会以 RGB 写入；如果替换色是灰色而原色也是灰色，则以灰度写入。要把任意颜色写回 CMYK 或专色油墨，需要一个此处尚未提供的配置文件。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3718
#, kde-format
msgid "Replacing a colour searches the drawing operators, not the pixels of photographs."
msgstr "替换颜色时搜索的是绘图操作符，而不是照片的像素。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3719
#, kde-format
msgid "Hairline widths are judged after the page's own scaling, but a width set before the matrix that shrinks it is only caught at the stroke itself, where the fix is applied to everything drawn afterwards at that width."
msgstr "细线宽度是在页面自身的缩放之后判定的，但如果宽度是在缩小它的矩阵之前设置的，就只能在描边时才发现，此时修正会应用到之后以该宽度绘制的所有内容。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3722
#, kde-format
msgid "Ink coverage and separation previews are measured through Ghostscript's own conversion to CMYK, which is not colour-managed unless the document carries an output intent."
msgstr "墨量覆盖率和分色预览是通过 Ghostscript 自己的 CMYK 转换测得的，除非文档带有输出意图，否则这一转换不受色彩管理。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3724
#, kde-format
msgid "Ink coverage is the highest total found on the page at 72 dots per inch, which is the number an ink limit is about; it is not an average."
msgstr "墨量覆盖率是以每英寸 72 点在页面上找到的最高总量，也就是墨量限制所针对的数值，它不是平均值。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3726
#, kde-format
msgid "A multi-ink DeviceN transform stored as a sampled function is read at its nearest sample rather than interpolated across every ink."
msgstr "以采样函数形式存储的多油墨 DeviceN 转换，会按最接近的采样点读取，而不会在每种油墨之间插值。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3728
#, kde-format
msgid "Colour inside a Type 3 font's glyph procedures is not converted."
msgstr "Type 3 字体字形过程内部的颜色不会被转换。"

#: src/core/ColourTools.cpp:3731
#, kde-format
msgid "This build has no colour management, so conversion into CMYK can only go through Ghostscript."
msgstr "此构建版本不含色彩管理，因此转换为 CMYK 只能通过 Ghostscript 进行。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:157
#, kde-format
msgctxt "an ICC colour profile with a number of components"
msgid "ICCBased(%1)"
msgstr "ICCBased(%1)"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:196
#, kde-format
msgctxt "a DeviceN colour space with a number of colourants"
msgid "DeviceN(%1)"
msgstr "DeviceN(%1)"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1295 src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1502
#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1930 src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2031
#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2091
#, kde-format
msgid "There is no picture called %1 on page %2."
msgstr "第 %2 页上没有名为 %1 的图片。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1320
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 lists a picture called %2 but never draws it."
msgstr "第 %1 页列出了名为 %2 的图片，但从未绘制它。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1328
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 on page %2 is a stencil, painted in whatever colour the page is using. Its pixels carry no colour of their own, so they cannot be edited here."
msgstr "第 %2 页上的 %1 是模板蒙版，用页面当前所用的颜色绘制。它的像素本身不带颜色，因此无法在此处编辑。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1336
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 on page %2 is stored as %3, which this tool cannot open. The picture is left exactly as it is rather than being replaced by something wrong."
msgstr "第 %2 页上的 %1 以 %3 格式存储，本工具无法打开这种格式。这张图片会完全保持原样，而不会被错误的内容替换。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1443
#, kde-format
msgid "Each page number needs a picture name to go with it."
msgstr "每个页码都需要有一个与之对应的图片名称。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1548
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 is stored as %2, which this tool cannot open, so it was left alone."
msgstr "%1 以 %2 格式存储，本工具无法打开这种格式，因此未作改动。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1560 src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1651
#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1735 src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1969
#, kde-format
msgid "The pixels of %1 could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取 %1 的像素。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1584
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 could not be re-encoded."
msgstr "无法重新编码 %1。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1672
#, kde-format
msgid "The adjusted pixels of %1 could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存 %1 调整后的像素。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1691
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 never draws %2, so there was nothing to change."
msgstr "第 %1 页从未绘制 %2，因此没有可更改的内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1715
#, kde-format
msgid "The part to keep must lie inside the picture and cannot be empty."
msgstr "要保留的部分必须位于图片之内，并且不能为空。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1747
#, kde-format
msgid "The transparency of %1 is stored in a form this tool cannot open, so cropping its pixels would leave the see-through parts in the wrong place."
msgstr "%1 的透明度以本工具无法打开的格式存储，因此裁剪它的像素会让透明部分留在错误的位置。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1761
#, kde-format
msgid "Cropping %1 would leave nothing behind."
msgstr "裁剪 %1 之后将不会剩下任何内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1769
#, kde-format
msgid "The cropped pixels of %1 could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存 %1 裁剪后的像素。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1783
#, kde-format
msgid "The cropped transparency of %1 could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存 %1 裁剪后的透明度。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1803
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 never draws %2, so there was nothing to crop."
msgstr "第 %1 页从未绘制 %2，因此没有可裁剪的内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1826
#, kde-format
msgid "There is no replacement picture to put in."
msgstr "没有可用于替换的图片。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1850
#, kde-format
msgid "The replacement picture could not be stored in the document."
msgstr "无法把替换图片保存到文档中。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1888
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 never draws %2, so there was nothing to replace."
msgstr "第 %1 页从未绘制 %2，因此没有可替换的内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1945
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 could not be opened for writing."
msgstr "无法打开 %1 进行写入。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1952 src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1996
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 could not be written."
msgstr "无法写入 %1。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:1960
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 on page %2 is stored as %3, which this tool cannot open."
msgstr "第 %2 页上的 %1 以 %3 格式存储，本工具无法打开这种格式。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2044
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 never draws %2, so there was nothing to remove."
msgstr "第 %1 页从未绘制 %2，因此没有可移除的内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2069
#, kde-format
msgid "A turn of %1 degrees leaves the picture where it was."
msgstr "旋转 %1 度不会改变图片原来的位置。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2100
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 never draws %2, so there was nothing to turn."
msgstr "第 %1 页从未绘制 %2，因此没有可旋转的内容。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2121
#, kde-format
msgid "One placement has a flattened matrix that cannot be reversed, so it was left where it was."
msgid_plural "%1 placements have a flattened matrix that cannot be reversed, so they were left where they were."
msgstr[0] "有 %1 处放置使用了无法反转的平面化矩阵，因此保持原位不变。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2128
#, kde-format
msgid "A turn that is not a quarter, a half or three quarters leaves the picture at an angle to the page, covering a different area than before."
msgstr "如果旋转的角度不是 90 度、180 度或 270 度，图片就会与页面成一定角度，覆盖的区域也和之前不同。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2135
#, kde-format
msgid "Turned, the picture reaches past the edge of the page."
msgstr "旋转之后，图片会超出页面边缘。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2255
#, kde-format
msgid "Effective resolution comes from the matrix that placed a picture, so a picture drawn several times on one page is reported at its largest placement."
msgstr "有效分辨率来自放置图片的矩阵，因此在同一页上多次绘制的图片，会按它最大的一次放置来报告。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2257
#, kde-format
msgid "Fax (CCITT, JBIG2) and JPEG 2000 pictures cannot be opened. They are listed and can be removed or deduplicated, but not recompressed, adjusted or cropped."
msgstr "传真格式 (CCITT、JBIG2) 和 JPEG 2000 图片无法打开。它们会被列出，可以移除或去重，但无法重新压缩、调整或裁剪。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2259
#, kde-format
msgid "Stencil masks, which take their colour from the page rather than carrying their own, are left alone by everything that edits pixels."
msgstr "模板蒙版从页面获取颜色，而不是自带颜色，因此所有编辑像素的操作都不会改动它们。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2261
#, kde-format
msgid "Pictures drawn inside an embedded drawing rather than straight onto a page are not listed, and neither are inline images."
msgstr "在嵌入图形内部绘制、而不是直接绘制到页面上的图片不会被列出，内联图像同样不会被列出。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2263
#, kde-format
msgid "Recompressing a picture that several pages share changes it for all of them, sized for the largest place it appears."
msgstr "重新压缩多个页面共用的图片会同时改变所有这些页面上的图片，尺寸按它出现的最大位置确定。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2265
#, kde-format
msgid "An operation naming one picture applies to every place that page draws it."
msgstr "指定某一张图片的操作，会应用到该页面绘制这张图片的每一处。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2266
#, kde-format
msgid "Adjusting pixels re-encodes them at high quality, which can leave a sharpened scan larger than it was. Recompress afterwards if size matters more than the last of the detail."
msgstr "调整像素时会以高质量重新编码，这可能让锐化后的扫描件比原来更大。如果文件大小比最后那点细节更重要，请随后重新压缩。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2268
#, kde-format
msgid "Colour is converted arithmetically: an ICC profile or a spot colour is read as its nearest device equivalent rather than through a colour engine."
msgstr "颜色是按算术方式转换的：ICC 配置文件或专色会被读作最接近的设备等效值，而不是通过色彩引擎处理。"

#: src/core/ImageEdit.cpp:2270
#, kde-format
msgid "Deduplication compares the stored bytes, so two copies of the same photograph saved at different quality settings are correctly left as two pictures."
msgstr "去重比较的是存储的字节，因此同一张照片以不同质量设置保存的两个副本，会正确地保留为两张图片。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1125
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "printing at full quality"
msgstr "以完整质量打印"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1126
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "printing"
msgstr "打印"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1129
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "copying text"
msgstr "复制文本"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1132
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "reading by assistive software"
msgstr "由辅助软件读取"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1135
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "editing"
msgstr "编辑"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1138
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "commenting"
msgstr "添加注释"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1141
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "filling in forms"
msgstr "填写表单"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1144
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a withheld PDF permission"
msgid "rearranging pages"
msgstr "重新排列页面"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1292
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item an annotation whose type the file does not give"
msgid "an annotation"
msgstr "批注"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1466
#, kde-format
msgid "One further place has the same problem; it is not listed individually."
msgid_plural "%1 further places have the same problem; they are not listed individually."
msgstr[0] "另有 %1 处存在同样的问题，未逐一列出。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1494
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a page size in millimetres"
msgid "%1 × %2 mm"
msgstr "%1 × %2 mm"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1504
#, kde-format
msgid "The font “%1” is not embedded, so its text will be set in whatever the reader happens to have instead."
msgstr "字体“%1”未嵌入，因此它的文本会改用阅读器上碰巧有的字体来显示。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1511
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is a Type 3 font: its letters are drawings rather than glyphs, which many workflows cannot search, scale or trap properly."
msgstr "“%1”是 Type 3 字体：它的字母是图形而不是字形，许多工作流程无法对它们正确地进行搜索、缩放或补漏白。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1518
#, kde-format
msgid "Only part of the font “%1” was embedded and it carries no /ToUnicode table, so its text cannot be copied, searched or read aloud."
msgstr "字体“%1”只嵌入了一部分，而且不带 /ToUnicode 表，因此它的文本无法复制、搜索或朗读。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1525
#, kde-format
msgid "The font “%1” states in its own licence field that it may not be embedded in a document."
msgstr "字体“%1”在它自己的许可证字段中声明，不得把它嵌入文档。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1541
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture is placed at %1 dpi, below the %2 dpi this profile asks for."
msgstr "有图片以 %1 dpi 放置，低于此配置文件要求的 %2 dpi。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1547
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture is placed at %1 dpi, far above the %2 dpi this profile asks for; it makes the file large without making the print better."
msgstr "有图片以 %1 dpi 放置，远高于此配置文件要求的 %2 dpi，这只会让文件变大，而不会让印刷效果变好。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1554
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture is stored as JPEG 2000, which older readers and some printing systems cannot decode."
msgstr "有图片以 JPEG 2000 格式存储，较旧的阅读器和某些印刷系统无法解码。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1560
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture names no colour space, so nothing in the file says what its numbers mean."
msgstr "有图片未指定颜色空间，文件中没有任何内容说明其数值代表什么。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1570
#, kde-format
msgid "The document paints in RGB. A press works in CMYK, so those colours will be converted by somebody else's settings unless they are converted here first."
msgstr "文档以 RGB 绘制。印刷机使用 CMYK，因此除非先在这里转换，这些颜色将按别人的设置来转换。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1575
#, kde-format
msgid "The document paints in CMYK, which browsers handle poorly and inconsistently; RGB is what a screen actually shows."
msgstr "文档以 CMYK 绘制，浏览器对它的处理很差且不一致；屏幕实际显示的是 RGB。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1583
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item separator in a list of colour names"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1580
#, kde-format
msgid "The document uses one spot colour (%2), which is a separate plate on press."
msgid_plural "The document uses %1 spot colours (%2), each of which is a separate plate on press."
msgstr[0] "文档使用了%1种专色 (%2)，每种在印刷时都是单独的一块印版。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1587
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing in the document defines its colours with an ICC profile, so every reader will guess at them."
msgstr "文档中没有用 ICC 配置文件定义颜色，因此每个阅读器都只能自行猜测。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1601
#, kde-format
msgid "The document uses transparency. Older printing systems flatten it themselves, and the result is not always what was drawn."
msgstr "文档使用了透明度。较旧的印刷系统会自行将其平面化，结果未必与绘制的内容一致。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1609
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item separator in a list of blend modes"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1606
#, kde-format
msgid "The document uses the blend mode %2, which is not reproduced identically everywhere."
msgid_plural "The document uses %1 blend modes (%2), which are not reproduced identically everywhere."
msgstr[0] "文档使用了%1种混合模式 (%2)，它们并非在所有环境中都能得到相同的再现。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1619
#, kde-format
msgid "The page has no trim box, so nothing in the file says where the finished sheet is to be cut."
msgstr "该页面没有裁剪框，文件中没有任何内容说明成品纸张应在何处裁切。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1625
#, kde-format
msgid "The page's crop box differs from its media box, so what is shown on screen is not the whole sheet."
msgstr "该页面的裁切框与其媒体框不同，因此屏幕上显示的并非整张纸。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1630
#, kde-format
msgid "The page has nothing drawn on it."
msgstr "该页面上没有绘制任何内容。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1642
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item separator in a list of annotation types"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1640
#, kde-format
msgid "One annotation reaches outside the page (%2)."
msgid_plural "%1 annotations reach outside the page (%2)."
msgstr[0] "有%1处批注超出了页面边界 (%2)。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1655
#, kde-format
msgid "The page measures %1 while the first page measures %2."
msgstr "该页面的尺寸为%1，而首页为%2。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1664
#, kde-format
msgid "The page is turned by %1 degrees while the first page is turned by %2."
msgstr "该页面旋转了%1度，而首页旋转了%2度。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1676
#, kde-format
msgid "The document contains scripts, or an action that runs when it is opened."
msgstr "文档包含脚本，或包含打开时自动运行的动作。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1680
#, kde-format
msgid "The document carries one other file inside it."
msgid_plural "The document carries %1 other files inside it."
msgstr[0] "文档内部携带了%1个其他文件。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1685
#, kde-format
msgid "The document does something of its own accord when it is opened."
msgstr "文档在打开时会自行执行某些操作。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1693
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is encrypted, so anything that has to open it later needs the password to still exist."
msgstr "文档已加密，因此以后要打开它的任何程序或个人都必须仍然拥有该密码。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1700
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item separator in a list of permissions"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1698
#, kde-format
msgid "The document withholds permission for %1. Readers are free to ignore that, and many do, but the ones that obey it will get in the way."
msgstr "文档不授予%1的权限。阅读器可以忽略这一点，很多阅读器也确实会忽略，但遵守它的阅读器会造成妨碍。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1708
#, kde-format
msgid "The document has no title, so readers and archives will show its file name instead."
msgstr "文档没有标题，因此阅读器和归档系统会改为显示其文件名。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1712
#, kde-format
msgid "The document's two sets of metadata disagree about its title: “%1” against “%2”."
msgstr "文档的两套元数据对标题的记录不一致：“%1”与“%2”。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1721
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is not tagged, so nothing in it says what is a heading, a table or a caption. Assistive software has only the reading order to go on."
msgstr "文档没有标记，其中没有任何内容说明哪些是标题、表格或图注。辅助软件只能依据阅读顺序来判断。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1726
#, kde-format
msgid "The document does not say what language it is in, so a screen reader will pronounce it in whatever language it was set up for."
msgstr "文档没有说明自身使用的语言，因此屏幕阅读器会按它自己设定的语言来朗读。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1733
#, kde-format
msgid "The document is not tagged, so its one picture has no text alternative."
msgid_plural "The document is not tagged, so none of its %1 pictures has a text alternative."
msgstr[0] "文档没有标记，因此其中的%1张图片都没有替代文本。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1741
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture is tagged but has no text alternative, so a screen reader can only announce that something is there."
msgstr "有图片虽已标记，但没有替代文本，屏幕阅读器只能报出此处有内容。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1757
#, kde-format
msgid "The page strokes a line of width zero, which means “as thin as this device can manage”: invisible on a press, a hairline on a laser printer."
msgstr "该页面描绘了宽度为零的线条，其含义是“该设备所能达到的最细”：在印刷机上不可见，在激光打印机上则是一条细线。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1762
#, kde-format
msgid "The page strokes a line %1 pt wide, below the %2 pt this profile asks for; it may disappear in print."
msgstr "该页面描绘的线条宽%1 pt，低于此配置文件要求的%2 pt；打印时可能会消失。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1771
#, kde-format
msgid "The page sets text at %1 pt, below the %2 pt this profile asks for."
msgstr "该页面的文本字号为%1 pt，低于此配置文件要求的%2 pt。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1840
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/A-1b (long-term archiving, strictest)"
msgstr "PDF/A-1b（长期归档，最严格）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1850
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/A-2b (long-term archiving, usual choice)"
msgstr "PDF/A-2b（长期归档，常用选择）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1859
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/A-3b (archiving with attachments allowed)"
msgstr "PDF/A-3b（允许附件的归档）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1863
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/X-1a (CMYK-only print exchange)"
msgstr "PDF/X-1a（仅 CMYK 的印刷交换）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1874
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/X-3 (print exchange, managed colour allowed)"
msgstr "PDF/X-3（印刷交换，允许色彩管理）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1886
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "PDF/X-4 (print exchange, transparency allowed)"
msgstr "PDF/X-4（印刷交换，允许透明度）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1896
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "Print-ready (what a commercial printer wants)"
msgstr "印刷就绪（商业印刷厂所需）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1925
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "Web (small, fast and readable in a browser)"
msgstr "网页（体积小、速度快、可在浏览器中阅读）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:1941
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item preflight profile"
msgid "Accessible (usable with a screen reader)"
msgstr "无障碍（可配合屏幕阅读器使用）"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2022
#, kde-format
msgid "A font the document uses but does not carry, so the text is set in a substitute."
msgstr "文档用到但未随文档携带的字体，因此文本以替代字体排版。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2025
#, kde-format
msgid "A partly embedded font with no /ToUnicode table, whose text cannot be copied or read aloud."
msgstr "部分嵌入的字体缺少 /ToUnicode 表，其文本无法复制，也无法朗读。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2028
#, kde-format
msgid "A Type 3 font, whose letters are drawings rather than glyphs."
msgstr "Type 3 字体，其字母是图形而非字形。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2031
#, kde-format
msgid "A font whose own licence field forbids embedding it."
msgstr "字体自身的许可字段禁止将其嵌入。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2034
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture placed at fewer dots per inch than the profile asks for."
msgstr "图片放置时的每英寸点数低于配置文件的要求。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2037
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture placed at far more dots per inch than anything can use."
msgstr "图片放置时的每英寸点数远高于任何设备能用到的程度。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2040
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture stored as JPEG 2000, which not every reader can decode."
msgstr "以 JPEG 2000 存储的图片，并非所有阅读器都能解码。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2043
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture that names no colour space."
msgstr "未指定颜色空间的图片。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2046
#, kde-format
msgid "RGB colour in a document meant for a press."
msgstr "面向印刷的文档中出现 RGB 颜色。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2049
#, kde-format
msgid "CMYK colour in a document meant for a screen."
msgstr "面向屏幕的文档中出现 CMYK 颜色。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2052
#, kde-format
msgid "Spot colours, each of which is a separate plate on press."
msgstr "专色，每种在印刷时都是单独的一块印版。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2055
#, kde-format
msgid "No ICC profile anywhere, so the colours are undefined."
msgstr "任何地方都没有 ICC 配置文件，颜色因而未定义。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2058
#, kde-format
msgid "No output intent, so nothing states the intended printing condition."
msgstr "没有输出意图，没有任何内容说明预期的印刷条件。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2061
#, kde-format
msgid "Transparency, which older printing systems have to flatten."
msgstr "透明度，较旧的印刷系统必须将其平面化。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2064
#, kde-format
msgid "Blend modes other than Normal, which are not reproduced identically everywhere."
msgstr "除“正常”以外的混合模式，并非在所有环境中都能得到相同的再现。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2067
#, kde-format
msgid "A page with no trim box, so the finished size is unstated."
msgstr "页面没有裁剪框，成品尺寸因而未说明。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2070
#, kde-format
msgid "A page whose crop box hides part of the sheet."
msgstr "页面的裁切框遮住了纸张的一部分。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2073
#, kde-format
msgid "Pages of more than one size in one document."
msgstr "同一文档中存在多种尺寸的页面。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2076
#, kde-format
msgid "Pages turned by different amounts in one document."
msgstr "同一文档中页面的旋转角度不一致。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2079
#, kde-format
msgid "A page with nothing drawn on it."
msgstr "页面上没有绘制任何内容。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2082
#, kde-format
msgid "Scripts, or an action that runs when the document is opened."
msgstr "脚本，或文档打开时自动运行的动作。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2085
#, kde-format
msgid "Other files carried inside the document."
msgstr "文档内部携带的其他文件。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2088
#, kde-format
msgid "Anything the document does of its own accord when opened."
msgstr "文档打开时自行执行的任何操作。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2091
#, kde-format
msgid "An annotation that reaches outside the page."
msgstr "超出页面边界的批注。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2094
#, kde-format
msgid "A document that needs a password, or carries one."
msgstr "需要密码或设有密码的文档。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2097
#, kde-format
msgid "Permissions the document withholds, such as printing or copying."
msgstr "文档不授予的权限，例如打印或复制。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2100
#, kde-format
msgid "A document with no title of its own."
msgstr "没有自身标题的文档。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2103
#, kde-format
msgid "Two sets of metadata that disagree with each other."
msgstr "彼此不一致的两套元数据。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2106
#, kde-format
msgid "An untagged document, which assistive software cannot navigate."
msgstr "未标记的文档，辅助软件无法在其中导航。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2109
#, kde-format
msgid "A document that does not say what language it is in."
msgstr "没有说明自身语言的文档。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2112
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture with no text alternative."
msgstr "没有替代文本的图片。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2115
#, kde-format
msgid "A line thin enough to vanish in print."
msgstr "细到打印时会消失的线条。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2118
#, kde-format
msgid "Text set smaller than the profile allows."
msgstr "字号小于配置文件允许值的文本。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2121
#, kde-format
msgid "Ink outside the trim box, which is either bleed or a mistake."
msgstr "裁剪框外的着墨内容，可能是出血，也可能是错误。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2137
#, kde-format
msgid "Rewrites the whole document through Ghostscript so that every font travels with it. This also converts the colours and adds an output intent, so it changes more than the fonts."
msgstr "通过 Ghostscript 重写整个文档，使每种字体都随文档一起嵌入。此操作同时会转换颜色并添加输出意图，因此改动的不只是字体。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2141
#, kde-format
msgid "Removes every script, the action that runs when the document is opened, and the actions attached to pages and annotations. Form fields that calculated anything will stop."
msgstr "移除所有脚本、文档打开时运行的动作，以及附加在页面和批注上的动作。原本进行计算的表单字段将不再工作。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2145
#, kde-format
msgid "Drops the files carried inside the document, including file-attachment annotations. They cannot be recovered from the result."
msgstr "移除文档内部携带的文件，包括文件附件批注。它们无法从结果中恢复。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2149
#, kde-format
msgid "Removes what the document does when it is opened, so it simply shows its first page."
msgstr "移除文档在打开时执行的操作，使其只是显示首页。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2152
#, kde-format
msgid "Gives every page that lacks one a trim box equal to its crop box, which states the finished size as being exactly what is visible."
msgstr "为每个缺少裁剪框的页面添加与其裁切框相同的裁剪框，从而将成品尺寸定为恰好是可见的范围。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2156
#, kde-format
msgid "Sets the document's title from its file name."
msgstr "根据文件名设置文档标题。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2159
#, kde-format
msgid "Reorders the file so a reader can show the first page before the rest has arrived."
msgstr "重新排列文件结构，使阅读器可以在其余内容到达之前先显示首页。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2162
#, kde-format
msgid "Writes the document out without its encryption. Only possible when it opens without a password."
msgstr "写出不带加密的文档。仅当文档无需密码即可打开时才可行。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2165
#, kde-format
msgid "Re-encodes the pictures at 300 dpi through Ghostscript. Detail beyond that is lost for good."
msgstr "通过 Ghostscript 以 300 dpi 重新编码图片。超出该分辨率的细节将永久丢失。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2187
#, kde-format
msgid "The document needs a password to be opened, so nothing inside it could be examined."
msgstr "文档需要密码才能打开，因此无法检查其中的任何内容。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2276
#, kde-format
msgid "A profile needs an identifier before it can be saved."
msgstr "配置文件必须有标识符才能保存。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2324
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not read “%1”."
msgstr "无法读取“%1”。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2335 src/core/Preflight.cpp:2343
#, kde-format
