#, kde-format
msgid "Fix available (%1): %2"
msgstr "可用修复 (%1): %2"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2904
#, kde-format
msgid "Asked for but not checked"
msgstr "已要求但未检查"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2905
#, kde-format
msgid "The profile names these rules, and this program cannot judge them. Nothing above says anything about them either way."
msgstr "配置文件指定了这些规则，而本程序无法对其做出判断。上面的内容对它们也不作任何结论。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2908
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info a rule id followed by what it looks for"
msgid "%1: %2"
msgstr "%1: %2"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2913
#, kde-format
msgid "What this check cannot promise"
msgstr "本检查无法保证的内容"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:2996
#, kde-format
msgid "Preflight report for %1"
msgstr "%1的印前检查报告"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3027
#, kde-format
msgid "This is a preflight check, not a certification. A file that passes here can still be refused by a strict validator such as veraPDF, which is the tool to reach for when somebody has to sign the file off."
msgstr "这是印前检查，而非认证。在这里通过的文件仍可能被 veraPDF 这类严格的验证工具拒绝；当有人必须对文件正式签核时，就应当使用那类工具。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3030
#, kde-format
msgid "Ink outside the trim box is not measured. Working out whether a mark is deliberate bleed or a mistake needs the exact outline of every glyph and path, which this does not compute, so the rule is named in the profile and reported as unchecked rather than quietly passed."
msgstr "裁剪框外的着墨内容不作测量。要判断某处痕迹是有意的出血还是错误，需要每个字形和路径的精确轮廓，而本程序并不计算这些，因此该规则会在配置文件中列出，并报告为未检查，而不是悄悄判定通过。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3033
#, kde-format
msgid "Only what is drawn on the pages themselves is examined. A font or a picture used solely inside an annotation's appearance, a pattern or a soft mask is not seen."
msgstr "只检查页面本身绘制的内容。仅在批注外观、图案或软遮罩内部使用的字体或图片不会被发现。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3035
#, kde-format
msgid "A font's licence is read from the embedding permission field that OpenType and TrueType fonts carry. Type 1 and bare CFF fonts have no such field, so nothing can be said about them either way."
msgstr "字体许可是从 OpenType 和 TrueType 字体所带的嵌入权限字段中读取的。Type 1 和纯 CFF 字体没有这样的字段，因此无法对它们作出任何结论。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3037
#, kde-format
msgid "Resolution is judged from where a picture is actually placed, so a picture that is never drawn is not judged at all. Pictures written directly into the page's instructions rather than stored as objects are counted as ink but not measured."
msgstr "分辨率是根据图片实际放置的位置来判断的，因此从未绘制的图片完全不作判断。直接写入页面指令、而非存储为对象的图片，只计为着墨内容，不作测量。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3040
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether a page is empty is decided by looking for drawing instructions, so a page that paints white on white, or draws entirely outside its own edges, counts as having something on it."
msgstr "页面是否为空是通过查找绘制指令来判定的，因此在白底上涂白、或完全绘制在自身边界之外的页面，也算作有内容。"

#: src/core/Preflight.cpp:3042
#, kde-format
msgid "Tagging is checked for its presence and for pictures without a text alternative. Whether the reading order makes sense, or a heading is really a heading, is a judgement no program makes well."
msgstr "标记只检查其是否存在，以及是否有图片缺少替代文本。阅读顺序是否合理、某个标题是否真的是标题，这类判断没有程序能做好。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1001
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing was marked for redaction."
msgstr "没有标记任何需要涂黑的内容。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1023
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the marked areas fall on a page."
msgstr "标记的区域没有一个落在页面上。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1065
#, kde-format
msgid "Page %1 holds a picture in a format that cannot be edited (fax or JPEG 2000). It was removed rather than left in place."
msgstr "第%1页中的图片采用了无法编辑的格式（传真或 JPEG 2000）。该图片已被移除，而不是保留在原处。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1113
#, kde-format
msgid "A picture that was edited is also shown somewhere that was not marked, so the original still travels with the file. Mark it everywhere it appears."
msgstr "被编辑过的图片还出现在未被标记的位置，因此原图仍然随文件一起保留。请在它出现的所有位置都做标记。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1140
#, kde-format
msgid "Text is removed character by character, so the rest of a line stays intact."
msgstr "文本按字符逐个移除，因此同一行的其余部分保持完整。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1141
#, kde-format
msgid "Pictures that overlap an area are edited pixel by pixel and re-saved."
msgstr "与区域重叠的图片会逐像素编辑并重新保存。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1142
#, kde-format
msgid "Text drawn inside an embedded drawing is not searched; the whole drawing is removed instead when it overlaps."
msgstr "不会搜索嵌入图形内部绘制的文本；当该图形与区域重叠时，会整个移除。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1144
#, kde-format
msgid "Fax and JPEG 2000 pictures cannot be edited in place. The page is flattened to an image instead, which loses its selectable text."
msgstr "传真和 JPEG 2000 图片无法就地编辑。相应页面会改为平面化为图像，这会失去其可选中的文本。"

#: src/core/Redaction.cpp:1146
#, kde-format
msgid "Attachments, and text hidden in the document's own properties, are not touched. Use Sanitise for those."
msgstr "附件以及隐藏在文档自身属性中的文本不会被改动。这些内容请使用“清理”功能处理。"

