#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:415
#, kde-format
msgid "The licence forbids embedding this font in a document."
msgstr "许可禁止将此字体嵌入文档。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:417
#, kde-format
msgid "The licence allows embedding for viewing and printing only, not for editing."
msgstr "许可仅允许为查看和打印而嵌入，不允许为编辑而嵌入。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:419
#, kde-format
msgid "The licence allows embedding, including in a document that can be edited."
msgstr "许可允许嵌入，包括嵌入到可编辑的文档中。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:421
#, kde-format
msgid "The licence puts no restriction on embedding this font."
msgstr "许可对嵌入此字体没有任何限制。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:424
#, kde-format
msgid "It may not be embedded in part, only whole."
msgstr "不得部分嵌入，只能整体嵌入。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgid "Only its bitmaps may be embedded, not its outlines."
msgstr "只能嵌入其位图，不能嵌入其轮廓。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:872
#, kde-format
msgid "No embedded font in this document matches what was asked for."
msgstr "本文档中没有与所要求内容相匹配的嵌入字体。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:952
#, kde-format
msgid "No two fonts in this document are the same font, so there is nothing to merge."
msgstr "本文档中没有任何两种字体是同一种字体，因此没有可合并的内容。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1014
#, kde-format
msgid "Every font in this document already says what its characters mean, or none of them says enough to work it out."
msgstr "本文档中的每种字体都已说明其字符的含义，或者没有一种字体提供了足以推断出含义的信息。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1299
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item a font with no name of its own"
msgid "an unnamed font"
msgstr "未命名的字体"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1306
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is not an sfnt programme: a Type 1 or compact outline cannot be cut down from the outside, so it was left exactly as it was."
msgstr "“%1”不是 sfnt 程序：Type 1 或紧凑轮廓字体无法从外部进行子集化，因此保持了原样。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1313
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is a composite font, whose codes are glyph numbers meaningful only inside the font programme itself. Working out which of them the pages use would mean reading the programme this is supposed to be cutting down, so it was left alone."
msgstr "“%1”是复合字体，其代码是仅在字体程序内部才有意义的字形编号。要弄清页面用到了其中哪些，就必须读取本应被子集化的那个程序，因此它未作改动。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1322
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing on any page draws with “%1”, so there was no set of glyphs to keep and it was left alone. Removing it outright is a different decision, and not this one."
msgstr "任何页面都没有使用“%1”绘制内容，因此没有需要保留的字形集合，它未作改动。直接将其移除是另一项决定，不属于这里的操作。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1328
#, kde-format
msgid "Nothing in this document says what “%1”'s character codes mean, so which glyphs the pages need could not be worked out. It was left alone."
msgstr "本文档中没有任何内容说明“%1”的字符代码含义，因此无法确定页面需要哪些字形。它未作改动。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1336
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1”'s programme is stored with a filter this cannot undo, so it could not be read, let alone rewritten."
msgstr "“%1”的程序采用了本程序无法还原的过滤器存储，因此无法读取，更谈不上重写。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1349
#, kde-format
msgid "its glyphs could not be worked out"
msgstr "无法确定其字形"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1348
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info a font that could not be cut down, and the reason"
msgid "“%1” was left alone: %2"
msgstr "“%1”未作改动：%2"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1353
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” is already no larger than the glyphs the pages use, so nothing was gained by rewriting it and it was left as it was."
msgstr "“%1”已经不大于页面所用字形的范围，重写它没有任何收益，因此保持了原样。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1393
#, kde-format
msgid "What a font can show is read from what the document says about it, which for a subset is only the characters that document used. The font on disc it came from may well hold more."
msgstr "字体能显示什么，是根据文档中对它的描述读取的；对于子集字体，那就只有该文档用到的字符。它所来自的磁盘字体文件很可能包含更多内容。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1395
#, kde-format
msgid "A font whose /ToUnicode map is present but unreadable is reported as having none, because that is what it is worth to anyone trying to copy the text."
msgstr "如果字体的 /ToUnicode 映射存在却无法读取，则报告为没有该映射，因为对任何想要复制文本的人来说，它的价值就是如此。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1397
#, kde-format
msgid "Removing an embedded font leaves the text in place but not its appearance: the reader substitutes whatever it has, and lines shift where the substitute is not the same width."
msgstr "移除嵌入字体会保留文本，但不会保留其外观：阅读器会用手头的任意字体替代，当替代字体宽度不同时，行的排布就会移位。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1399
#, kde-format
msgid "Only subsets that are the same font programme with the same encoding are merged. Subsets holding different glyphs are left alone, because combining those means rewriting every page that uses them."
msgstr "只有属于同一字体程序且编码相同的子集才会被合并。包含不同字形的子集不作改动，因为合并它们意味着要重写所有使用它们的页面。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1401
#, kde-format
msgid "A /ToUnicode map can be written for an ordinary font but not for a composite one, whose codes are glyph numbers with no stated meaning."
msgstr "可以为普通字体写入 /ToUnicode 映射，但无法为复合字体写入，因为复合字体的代码是没有既定含义的字形编号。"

#: src/core/FontInventory.cpp:1403
#, kde-format
msgid "Fonts used only by a document's interactive form, and not by any page, are not listed."
msgstr "仅被文档的交互式表单使用、而未被任何页面使用的字体不会列出。"

