#, kde-format
msgid "Note: a radio group keeps where its buttons are, unless it has only one. To move them, take the group out and add it again."
msgstr "注意：单选按钮组会保持其各按钮的位置，除非组中只有一个按钮。要移动它们，请先移除该组，再重新添加。"

